<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Luhka</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUHKAA Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luhka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUHKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Thangkdaw Luhka naw Jesuh cun Isarela ngthumkhän küikyanbawi la nghngicim khyang avana küikyanbawia pyenki. Jesuh cun Bawipa Ngmüimkhya naw “M'yenkseki hea veia thangkdaw sang khaia” a khü; acuna thangkdaw cun khyang avana hama kyaki tia Luhka naw yuki. Jekyainaka mawng pi aktäa Luhka üng ngdangki. Aktunga acuteinaka kyangkdäm he üng Jesuha lawnak pyen lü, akdüta Jesuh khankhawa a kai be üng pi pyen beki. Jesuh khankhawa a kai be käna Khritjan jumeinak la Khritjana dämduh lawnaka mawng pi ahin yuki bä naw “Ngsä hea khutbi” tia cauk üng a yuka kyaki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Khankhawngsä hea ng’äinak, toksäm he Jesuha hminaka ami cehnak, Temple k'uma hnasena kba Jesuha cehnak, Samarih khyang kdaw am msuimcäpnak a pyenak la Capa khyüka mawng he cun ahina Thangkdaw däng üng va jah hmuha kyaki. Thangkdaw akyang avan üng ktaiyünak, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim, Jesuha khutbi üng nghnumi hea bilawhnak he la katnaka phäh Mhnama mhlätnak he cun aktunga jah mdanga kyaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawi he</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptican Johan la Jesuha hminaka mawng <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptican Johana khutbi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jesuh baptican a khanak la hlawhlep a khameinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jesuh naw Kalile khawa angdanga khutbi a binak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kalile üngka naw Jerusalema <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anghnu säiha pat la Jerusalema peia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bawipa thawhnak be, ngdangnak, la khankhawa a kainak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Ka püi Theophiluh aw; ajana thawn khawikia mawng cun, khyang khawjah naw mi ksunga pyena ngthu yu khai hea ana ktha na khawiki he. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Akcüka ana hmu u lü ngthu ana sang khawiki he naw mi veia ami pyen ana yuki he. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Acunakyase nang angvai aw, angsinga ka ngaihkyu käna, acuna mawng cun, angsinga na hama yuk üng daw khaia ngaikyu veng. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Ajana ngthu ami ning mthei he cen ngthungtak ni ti na ksingnak vaia ka yuka kyaki ni.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana Hmi law vaia Mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1Khro 24:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Judah khawa sangpuxang Herod a bawi kcün üng, ktaiyü Abijaha khuikyawng üngka ktaiyü mat Zakharih ngming naki awmki; acun naw ktaiyüa khuikyawng üngka a khyunak, a ngming cun Elizabeta kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ani nghngih Pamhnama mik hmuha akdawa xüngseiki xawi, pyen vai am hlü khaia Bawipa ngthupet la, ngthummkhän avan läki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Elizabet cingkia kyase am ca ni lü, aktäa xüki xawi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Mhmüp mat üng Zakharih cun ktaiyüa khüih khawia kba Pamhnama Temple k'uma a khüih k'um üng, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>ktaiyüa thuma Bawipa Temple k'uma lut lü, ng'uinghnam mkhih khaia xüa kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Acunüng, ng'uinghnam a mkhih k'um üng khyang he ami van kpunga ktaiyüki he.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Acunüng, Bawipa khankhawngsä mat Zakhariha veia ngdang law lü, ng'uinghnam mkhihnaka kpat lama ngdüi lawki. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakharih naw khankhawngsä a hmuh üng kyüh lü ngxetki. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw, “Zakharih, ä kyüa, na ktaiyünak ngjak pänga kya ve, acunakyase na khyu Elizabet naw cangpyang mat ca na se, Johana na sui khai. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Nang jekyai lü na hlim khai, khyang khawjah ania hmi lawa phäha jekyai khai he. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Num 6:3</ref> </char></note> Ani cun Bawipa ngaiha kyäp khai, ju naki i am ei aw khai. A nua puk k'um üng tün lü ngcimcaihkia ngmüimkhya am be khai. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Acunüng ani naw Isarela ca he khawjah, ami Bawipa Pamhnama veia jah nghlat sak be khai. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref> </char></note>Ani naw pa he la ca he alanga jah lawpüi be lü, am cingcaihki he ngsungpyunak ksingnaka lam üng jah nghlat sak be lü, khyang he Pamhnama phäha jah ngtünngceisak khai, Elijaha ngmüimkhya la khyaihbahnak am Pamhnama maa cit khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Acunüng Zakharih naw khankhawngsä üng, “Ikba acun ka ksing vai aw? Kei pakse ni, ka xü pängki, ka khyu pi nukpüi lü, a khawkum xü pängki ni,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">9:2</ref> </char>
    </note>Khankhawngsä naw, “Kei Kabriel, Pamhnama ma ngdüikia ka kyaki, nanga veia hina jekyainaka ngthu lawpüi khaia tüih lawa ka kyaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Cunsepi Ngaia, ka ngthu akcün üng kümkawi law khai am na juma phäha, hina ka ngthu am a kümkawi law ham üng am ngthuhei thei lü, na ang khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Khyang he Zakharih kpunga ana ngängki he, Temple k'uma a di lawa phäha aktäa cäiki he.<verse eid="LUK 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Acunüng, a luh law be üng ami veia am ngthuhei thei lü, a kut am jah kha hü se, Temple k'uma mdannak hmukia ami ksing.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Acunüng, ktaiyü a binaka kcün ngpäng se a ima cit beki. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Acunkäna a khyu Elizabet m’yai law lü im k'uma khya mhma ngküpki. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Acunüng Elizabet naw “Khyang hea ami na ksekhanak Pamhnam naw na kpüi lü a na lawhin pet ni,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Mmi law vaia Mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Acunüng, akhya khyuk üng Pamhnam naw khankhawngsä Kabriel Kalile khaw, Nazareta a tüih. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mt 1:18</ref> </char></note>Acuna nglami cun Davita pakhui üngka, Josep ngming nakia khyu vaia ami mkhyäpa kyaki. Nglamia ngming cun Marih naki. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw Mariha veia lut lü, “Pamhnama hlüei la jekyainak, dim’yenak am awma, Pamhnam na veia awm ve, nghnumi he avan üng na josen säih ve,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Acuna khankhawngsäng naw i a ti hlünak am ksing lü aktäa cäi lü kyüki. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw, “Marih aw, ä kyüa; Pamhnam na veia dawki ni, <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mt 1:21</ref> </char></note> m’yai lü, kpamica na ca khai, a ngming Jesuha na sui khai. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32,33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Hesa 9:7</ref> </char></note> Ani cun kyäpsawk law se, ak'hlüng säiha Capa ti khai he, Bawipa Pamhnam naw a pu Davita mäiha sangpuxanga pawh law khai. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Ani naw Jakopa mjü he angläta jah uk se, a khaw am düt khai ni,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Marih naw, khankhawngsä üng, “Kei am ka ceimahki hin ikba acunkba kya thei khai aw?” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Khankhawngsä naw msang lü, “Ngmüimkhya Ngcim na khana pha law se, hlüng säihkia johit naw ning hlawp tawm law khai, acunakyase hmi law khaia khyang ngcim pi Mhnama Capa ti khai he. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Acunüng ngaia, cingki ami ti khawi na püi Elizabet pi a xü käna kpamica m’yai na se atuh khya khyuk law pängki. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Gen 18:14</ref></char></note>Pamhnama am a ti thei i am awm naw,” a ti. <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Marih naw, “Kei Bawipa ana m’ya nu ni, na ngthua kba ka khana kya kawm,” ti se, acunüng khankhawngsä naw a ceh tak.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elizabeta veia Marih Citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Acunüng, Marih tho law lü, angxita mcunga awmkia mlüh, Judah khawnu mata cit lü, <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakhariha ima lutki naw, Elizabet a hnukset. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Acunüng, Elizabet naw Marih a hnukset a sim la, a puk k'uma naca ngsün law se, Elizabet ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be law lü, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>angsanga, “Nghnumi he avan üng na jo sen säih ve, na canak vai pi a jo sen ve! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Ka Bawipaa nu, ka veia na lawnak sen vaia ta ia ngjo ni? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Na na hnuksetnak ka hnga üng a luh la hnasen jekyai lü ka k'uma ngsün ve. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Jumeikia nghnumi pi a jo sen ve, isetiakyaküng a veia Bawipa naw ngthu a pyen he cun kümkawi law khai hea akya phäha kyaki” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mariha Mküimtonak Ng'äi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Sam 2:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunüng Marih naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ka mlungmthin naw Bawipa mküimto ve;<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ka ngmüimkhya pi na küikyankia Pamhnama khana aktäa jekyai ve,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:48:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Sam 1:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>a na m'yanua hnemnak hmu lü, na süm ve;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">atuh üng tün lü, khyang avan naw a jo senki na ti na khai he.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Akyan säih naw ka khana akyäp säih na pawh pe ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">A ngming pi, ngcimcaiki ni;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>A m’yeneinak cun angsawn täh se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">amät kyühki hea khana awmsaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>“A ban am a kyannak mdang lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">khyang awhcaki he cun ami ngaikyunak am akcea a jah ngtaisak.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref> </char>
    </note>“Ami bawingawhnak üng ngawki hea bawi he a hnemnaka jah khya lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ami mlung hnemsaki he a jah mhlünmtai.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>“Ami ei cawiki he, akdaw am jah kphü lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">bawimangki he, ami kut xawnga a jah tüih.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>“Mi pupa he, a jah na khyütamnakpüi kümkawisak lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">a m'ya Isarel he jah kpüi khaia law ve.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Gen 17:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> A jah m'yeneinak Abraham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">la a ngsawn hea veia angläta süm ve” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Acunüng Marih, Elizabeta veia khya kthum awm lü a ima cit beki.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana Hmi lawa Mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elizabet na a hmi vai kha law se, kpamicaa caki. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>A impeiloceng he la, a paca he naw, Pamhnam naw a m'yenei ni ti ksing u lü, aktäa ami jekyaipüi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng pat mat küm se, naca a vun mawih vaia law u lü, a ngming a pa ngminga kba Zakhariha sui vaia ami bü. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Acunüng a nu naw, “Ka! Johana sui vai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Acunüng amimi naw, “Na ngsawn, na khui üngka, acunkba ngming naki u am ve khawi naw,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Acunüng a pa ami kut am, “A ngming ua sui üng daw khai aw?” tia ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakharih naw, a yuknak vai lungphek kthäh lü, “A ngming Johan,” ti lü yu se, ami van cäi lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Acunüng angxita ngthuhei law be thei lü Pamhnam mküimto lawki. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Acunüng, ami van cäicah lawki he. Acuna mawng cun Judah khaw avan üng ngthang hüki. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Acun ngjaki avan naw, ami mlung k'uma ta u lü, “Acuna hnasen cun ia mäih vai ni?” ami ti. Ani cun Pamhnam naw a johit am awmpüiki tia ami van naw ksingki he.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zakhariha Malam Pyenak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Johana pa Zakharih cun ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be lü,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Isarel hea Bawipa Pamhnam cun mi mhlünmtai vai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">a khyang he jah law si lü, jah mhlät be ve,<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>A m'ya Davita ngsawn he</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ak'hlüngtaia Küikyan bawi jah pe ve,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Acun cun a sahma ngcim he üng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">ajana a jah na khyütamnaka kba,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>mi ye he la jah hnengkiea kut üngka naw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">la küikyan khaia,<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>mi pupa hea veia m'yeneinaka ngthumkhän ana tak a kümsak vai la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">a khyütam ngcim a sümnak vaia,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>mi pa Abrahama veia a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">khyütamnaka kba,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>mi ye hea kut üng mi lät lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">am kyü u lü,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>mi xüna küt üng ngcimcaihnak la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">ngsungpyunak am a ma a khut mi pawhnak vaia,<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>nang ka ca, Bawipa a lam pyang khaia na cit ma khaia kyase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ak'hlüng säih Mhnama sahma ning ti na khai he,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>ami katnak he jah mhlätnak am,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">küikyanak, a khyang he üng jah ksingsak khai,<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>mi Pamhnam cun m'yeneinak la hniphnawinak am bebang lü mi khana küikyanaka nghngi vai law sak khai,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Hesa 9:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> a nghmüpnak la, thihnaka k'uma awmki he, akvai jah pe khai la, mlung üpnaka lama jah cehpüi khai” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Acunüng, a nghmaw cun ngbaü law lü, a mlung ngaihnak kyan law ksetam lü, Isarel hea veia am a ngdang law hama üng khawkhyawng khawa awmki.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Mmi lawa Mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mt 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Acunüng, sangpuxang Awkastan naw Romah khaw avan üng ami ngming ami yuk vaia ngthu a jah pet. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Ahina ngming yuknak cun Kurenih, Siria üng a bawi kum üng akcük säiha ngming yuknaka kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Acunüng, khyang ami van ami ngming yu khai hea, ami khaw nu phäh phäha citki he.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Josep pi Davita khui üngka la ksawna akyaa phäha, Kalile khaw Nazaret üngka naw, Judah hne Davita mlüh Bethlehem ami tia, <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>a khyu vaia ami mkhyäp Marih a m’yai mah am ani ngming yu khai xawia citki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Bethlehema ani ve üng Marih cun a canak vaia mhmüp küm lawki. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Acunüng, a ca kcük kpamica a canak, jih am hlawp lü, khin ima am ani ngsut hnga phäha, sepata einak kawng üng a msän.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Toksäm he la Khankhawngsä he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Acunüng, acuna khawa toksäm he, kpyawnga ami to he jah k’äih u lü mthana awmki he. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ng'ngaia Bawipa khankhawngsä mat ami maa ngdüi law lü, Bawipa a hlüngtainak ami ksunga vai law se, aktäa kyükyawki he. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw, “Ä kyü ua, ng'ngai ua, khyang avana phäha, jekyainaka thangkdaw ka ning jah thak lawki ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>“Tuhngawi Davita mlüha küikyan bawi, Bawipa Khritaw, nami hama hmiki. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>“Hin hin nami msingnak vaia kya ve: Hnasen jih am hlawp, sepata einak kawng üng ngjän se nami hmu khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Acunja, khankhawngsä pä he la khankhawngsä cun Pamhnama veia mhlünmtainak ng’äi mcuki he.<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Pamhnam cun ak'hlüng säih khankhaw cäpa hlüngtai se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">khawmdek khana a jah jenak khyang hea khana ngkhawtnak ve se,” tia, Pamhnam mküimtoki he.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Acunüng, hinkba kyaki, khankhawngsä he naw khankhawa ami jah cehtak be la, toksäm he naw, “Atuh Bethlehem khaw cäpa mi cit u lü, Bawipa naw ngthu a jah mtheh pha lawki cun mi va teng vai,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Acunüng cit tele u lü, Marih, Josep la, sepata einak kawng üng ngjänkia hnasen ami jah hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Acunüng, ami va hmuh khap üng, hnasena mawng khankhawngsä naw a jah mtheh cun aktäa ami pyen. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Acunüng, toksäm hea ngthu pyen ngjaki he avan cun, aktäa cäicahki he. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Cunsepi Marih naw, acuna ngthu avan cun ngai lü, a mlung k'uma a tak. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Toksämke naw, khankhawngsäa a jah mtheha kba, ahmäi hmu u lü ami sima phäha, Pamhnam mhlünmtai mküimto u lü cit beki he.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Ngming ami Sui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Acunüng, a vun mawihnak vai pat mat aküm käna a nua puk k'um üng am a awm hlan üng khankhawngsä he naw ami suia kba, Jesuha ami sui.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Temple k’uma ami Cehpüi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lev 12:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunüng, Mosia ngthumkhän peta kba, ngcimcaihnak vaia mhmüp a küm law üng, a nu la a pa naw hnasen cun Jerusalema cehpüi ni lü, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ex 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref> </char></note> ca kcük kpamica he cun Pamhnama ka vaia jah ngcimcaihsak vai tia Mosia ngthumkhän üng a awma kba, Pamhnama veia pe ni lü, <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Bawipa ngthumkhän üng mümca nghngih, am acunüng mümkyap nghngih jah hnim vai ti lü a awma kba ani pawh.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Acunüng, Jerusalema Simeon ngming naki khyang mat awmki, acun cun khyangsungpyun, Pamhnam jum lü, Isarel hea küikyanak vai a na ngak'uhki, a khana ngmüimkhya ngcim naw a awmnaka kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Ani cun Bawipa Khritaw am a hmuh hama küt üng am thi khai tia ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw ana ksingsaka kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Acunüng, hnasen Jesuh, a nu la a pa naw Temple k'uma, thuma kba pawh pet vaia ani lawpüi üng, Simeon cun ngmüimkhya naw ngkhahpüi se Temple k'uma law lü, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>a kut am hnasen kpawmki naw, Pamhnam mküimto lü,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Bawipa aw, atuh na ngthua kba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">na m'ya dim’yenak am na cehsak be khaia kya ve,<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>na küikyanak atuh ka mik am hmu veng,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>khyang avana hmuh vaia na pyan cen:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1">Hesa</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>
    </note>Paca kcea veia na vainak sang hü khai la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">na khyang Isarel hea hlüngtainak vai cun,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Acunüng acunkba hnasena mawng a pyen cun a nu la a pa naw aktäa ani kyühkhyai. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Acunüng Simeon naw ani cun josenak am kbe lü, a nu Mariha veia, “Ngaia, hina hnasen hin Isarel he üng khyang khawjaha pyehnak vai la küikyanak vaia Mhnam naw a xü ni. Acunüng khyang naw ami pyenei vaia msingnaka mcawna kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>“Khyang khawjaha ami ngaihkyunak a ngdangnak vaia, kcim naw namäta mlung pi ning sun khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Acunüng sahma hmeinu mat Anna ami ti Panuelaha canu, Ashea mjü üngka awmki. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Acunüng kum khyüh cei mah lü kum khyetkip la kphyü lawki hmeinu, Pamhnama Temple am ceh ta lü, amhmüp amthan, a ei jeih lü ktaiyü lü, Pamhnam sawkhahki. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Ani pi acun la Pamhnama ima law lü, Pamhnama veia jekyainaka ngthu pyen lü, Jerusalema lätnak vai ngak'uheiki hea veia, hnasena mawng cun a jah mtheh.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareta ami Nghlat bea Mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mt 2:23</ref> </char>
    </note>Acunüng, Bawipa ngthupeta kba Josep la Marih cun ahmäi ani pawh khap üng, animäta khaw Kalile, Nazaret khawa cit beki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Acunüng, anghmaw cun ngbaü law lü, a mlung ngainak kyan law ksetam tam lü, ksingkhyapnak am be law se, Pamhnama m'yeneinak a khana awmki.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anghmaw Jesuh, Temple k'uma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ex 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Deut 16:1-8</ref> </char>
    </note>Kphyawnpawi buhpawhnaka Jesuha nu la a pa akum tä se Jerusalema cit khawiki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Acunüng, Jesuh a kum xaleinghngih üng buhpawhnaka, ami thum khawia kba Jerusalema hang citki he. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Acuna mhmüp ngpäng se, ami nghlat law be üng, kpamica Jesuh cun Jerusalema awmei hütki. Acun, a nu la Josep naw am ani ksing. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>A nu la Josep naw Jesuh cun a püi anghmawea veia awmkia ngai ni lü, mhmüp mat ana citki xawi, acunüng ami püi he la ami mjü hea veia ani sui hü. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Acunüng, am ani hmu üng, Jerusalema nghlat be ni lü ani sui. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Acunüng, amhmüp kthum käna, Temple k'uma saja hea ksunga ngaw lü, ami pyen jah ngai lü, jah kthäh lü awm se ani hmuh be. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Acunüng, a ngthu ngjaki he naw, a ksingnak la a jah msangnakea phäha aktäa cäiki he. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Acunüng, ani va hmuh üng, aktäa cäi ni lü, a nu naw, “Ka capa aw, ivai hinkba na awmki ni? Ngaia na pa la kei cäi ni lü, kani ning sui hüki hin,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ivai nani na sui hüki ni? Ka pa ima ka awm khai ti am nani ksingki aw?” </char>ti lü a jah msang. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Cunsepi, a jah msangnaka suilam cun am ani ksing.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Acunüng, ani hlawnga law be lü, Nazareta law beki, acuia ani mtheh ngai lü awmki. Acunüng a nu naw, avan a mlung k'uma a tak. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Ngthk 3:4</ref></char></note> Acunüng, Jesuh cun ngvai lawca lü, ksingkhyapnak am kümbe law ksetam lü, Mhnam la khyang hea mik khamei law ksetam tamki.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana Ngthu Pyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Ketah sangpuxang Tiberiha a bawi k'um, akum xaleimhma üng, Pontas Pilat cun Judah khaw ukia kyaki. Herod cun Kalile bawia kya lü, a na Philip cun Ituhrih la Tarakonik khawa bawi lü, Abilin khawa Luhtari cun bawia kyaki, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Acunüng, Anna la Kaiphah ktaiyü ngvaia ani kya k'um üng, khawkhyawng khawa Pamhnama ngthu, Zakhariha capa Johana veia pha lawki. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Acunüng, Johan cun Jordan tuinu kama, khaw avan üng cit hü lü, “Pamhnam naw nami katnak aning jah mhlätnak vaia, ngjut u lü baptican khan ua”<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Hesa 40:3-5</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Sahma Hesajah naw, “Khawkhyawng khawa ngpyang hüki mata ngthu cun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Bawipa lam pyang ua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">a lam he jah ngdüngsak ua.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Nghawi naküt jah kbe ua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Mcung naküt pi jah ngmisak u lü, lam ngkhep he pi jah ngdüngsak ua,<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>khyang avan naw Pamhnama küikyanak hmu khai he’ tia, a ng’yuka kba,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, khyang he baptican khan khai hea Johana veia lawki he üng, “Kphyuksea mjü he aw! Mhnama mlungsonak pha law khai üng nami lät khaia u naw aning jah mtheh ni? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char></note> Acunakyase nami ngjutnak cun nami bilawh üng mdan ua. ‘Kami pu Abraham ni’ ä ti ua. Ka tiki ni, Pamhnam naw hina lung üngka Abrahama ca hea jah mcawm theiki ni. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mt 7:19</ref></char></note> “Thingphung avan üng xei msäna kyaki. Akdawa am ngtheihkia thing avan cun ksawm pit u lü mei üng tawna kya khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Acunüng khyang he naw, “Ini kami pawh kawm?” tia ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Johan naw jah msang lü, “Upi kcu nghngih taki naw am taki üng mat pe se; upi ei vai taki naw am taki üng pe se,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lk 7:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ngcawn klawk he pi a veia baptican khan khaia law u lü, “Saja aw, ini kami pawh kawm?” tia ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Johan naw, “Ami ning jah kthähsaka däm bawki ä kthäh ti ua,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Acukba yekap he naw pi, “Ini kami pawh kawm?” tia ami kthäh. Acunüng Johan naw, “Ua ngui pi ä yutei ua, amdanga khyang i ä kpuk sawxat ua, nami ngkhengnak khäksak ua,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Acunüng, khyang he naw ngak'uhei u lü, khyang avan naw Johan cun ami mlung k'uma, “Mesijaha am kyaki aw?” tia ami ngaihkyu k'um üng, <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Johan naw, jah msang lü, “Kei naw tui üng baptican ka ning jah khansak khawiki; cunsepi keiha kyäp bawki law khai, a khawdawk yüi kphyan pe khaia pi am ngkawi nawng; ani naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim la mei am baptican ning jah khan lawsak khai, <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Angsi a jahnak vaia a kut üng kphya kpawmki; angtak kheia ta lü angsi cun am thi theihkia mei üng mkhih khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Acunüng ami ngneiksak ami thuhlaih vaia jah mcäi lü, thangkdaw pi jah mthehki. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19,20:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char></note> Cunsepi sangpuxang Herod cun a na a khyu Herodih a khyunaka phäha la katnak khawjah a pawha phäha Johan naw a jüih. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Acunüng Herod naw aksehlena Johan cun thawngim üng a khyüm.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Baptican Khanak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mt 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Khyang he ami van baptican ami khan law päng üng, Jesuh pi baptican khan hngaki. Ktaiyü se khankhaw nghmawng law lü, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char></note> Ngmüimkhya Ngcim cun mümca kba ngdang law lü a khana cu lawki, acunüng khankhaw üngka naw ngthu, “Nang ka jawng'engnak leng lenga ka capa; na khana ka jekyai leng lengki ni,” tia ngthang lawki.<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Ngsawn Tähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mt 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Jesuh khawkum thumkip acum üng Pamhnama khut tünei lawki. Khyanga ngaiha ani cun Josepa capa kyaki. Acun cun Helia capa kyaki, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Helia pa Mathat, Mathata pa Levih, Leviha pa Mekhih, Melkiha pa Janai, Janaia pa Josep, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Josepa pa Matatih, Matatiha pa Amos, Amosa pa Nahum, Nahuma pa Esali, Esalia pa Nakai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nakaia pa Mat, Mata pa Matatih, Matatiha pa Seming, Seminga pa Josek, Joseka pa Joda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Jodaa pa Jonan, Jonana pa Resa, Resaa pa Zerubabel, Zerubabela pa Selatih, Selatiha pa Nerih, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neriha pa Melkih, Mekiha pa Adi, Adia pa Kosam, Kosama pa Elamadam, Elamadama pa Erah, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eraha pa Josuh, Josuha pa Elisa, Elisaa pa Jorim, Jorima pa Mathat, Mathata pa Levih, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Leviha pa Simeon, Simeona pa Judah, Judaha pa Josep, Josepa pa Jonam, Jonama pa Elakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakima pa Melah, Melaha pa Mena, Menaa pa Matatha, Matathaa pa Natan, Natana pa Davit, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Davita pa Jesse, Jessea pa Obet, Obeta pa Bozah, Bozaha pa Salmon, Salmona pa Nashon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashona pa Aminadap, Aminadapa pa Ani, Ania pa Heron, Herona pa Pereh, Pereha pa Judah, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Judaha pa Jakop, Jakopa pa Isak, Isaka pa Abraham, Abrahama pa Terah, Teraha pa Nahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahora pa Seruh, Seruha pa Reuh, Reuha pa Pelek, Peleka pa Ebar, Ebara pa Shelah, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shelaha pa Kenan, Kenana pa Aphazad, Aphazada pa Shem, Shema pa Nawe, Nawea pa Lameh, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameha pa Matuselah, Matuselaha pa Enawk, Enawka pa Jaret, Jareta pa Mahalelah, Mahalelaha pa Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenana pa Enos, Enosa pa Shet, Sheta pa Adam, Adama pa Mhnama kyaki.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Hlawhlep Kameinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mt 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Jesuh Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am beki, Jordan tuinu üngka naw a nghlat law be üng Ngmüimkhya naw khawkhyawng khawa cehpüi se, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>mhmüp kphyükip khawyai naw a hlawhlep. Acunüng ipi am ei se, anghnua a ei cawi lawki.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Khawyai naw, “Nang Mhnama capa na kyak üng, hina lung muka ngthawn law khaia ngthu pea,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Deut 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunsepi Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang cun ei däng üng am xüng, tia cangcim üng ng’yuki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Acunüng khawyai naw Jesuh khawmcung a hlüngnaka kaipüiki naw khawmdeka khana khawe avan mik mkhyüp üng jah mhmuh lü,<verse eid="LUK 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>“Hin he avan ka veia peta kyaki, upi ka ngaih üng ka peki, hina ana avan la a kyäpsawknak avan ka ning pe khai, <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>acunakyase na sawhkhah lü, avan na kaa kya khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Deut 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw a veia, <char style="wj">“Cangcim üng, ‘Na Bawipa Pamhnam sawhkhah lü, ani däng na khüih vai,’ tia ng’yuki,’”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Acunüng khawyai naw Jerusalema cehpüiki naw, Temple khan, amsumnaka ta lü, “Mhnama capa na kyak üng hin üngka naw mcea namät kcoa, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Sal 91:11</ref></char></note> ‘Ani naw khankhawngsä he ning na k’äih u lü, ning na mcei khai hea jah mcawn khai, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>na khaw am lung am na su khaia, ami kut am ning na mcei khai he’ tia, ng’yüki,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Deut 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cunsepi Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na Bawipa, Pamhnam ä na mhnütei vai,’ tia kyaki ni,”</char> ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Acunüng khawyai naw a hlawhlepnak vai avan am a hlawhlep käna asäng a ceh tak ma.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalilea Jesuh Khutbi Cuteiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mt 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Acunüng Jesuh, Ngmüimkhya Ngcima khyaihnak am Kalilea nghlat be se, a mawng cun acuna khaw pei avan üng ngthang hüki. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Acunüng sinakoka jah mthei hü se, khyang avan naw ngak u lü, ami mhlünmtai.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Nazareta ami Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mt 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Acunüng angvainak Nazareta a law be üng a thum khawia kba Sabbath mhmüp üng, Sinakoka k'uma lut lü ngthungcim khe khaia ngdüiki. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Acunüng sahma Hesajah cauk ami pet. Acunüng cauk ktawm a kphyan üng hinkba angyuknak a kheh,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18-19:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Hesa 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Bawipa Ngmüimkhya ka khana awmki, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ani naw thangkdaw m'yyenkse hea veia ka sang khaia a na xü. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Ami mlung naki he ka jah mhlät be khai, khuikhaki hea veia lätnaka thangkdaw ka sang khai, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">amikmü he ka jah mdaw be khai, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ami jah man he ka jah mhlät khaia la, </char><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Bawipa naw a khyang he a jah küikyanak vaia kcün pha lawki ti, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">
    <char style="wj">ka sang khaia ana tüih law ni,” tia kyaki.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Jesuh naw cauk ktawmki naw jah pe be lü ngawki. Acunüng Sinakoka k'uma ngawki he avan naw kcävä u lü ami teng. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tuhngawi hina thungcim nami sim kümkawi law ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Acunüng ami van naw, a ngthu pyen cun aktäa ngai hlü u lü, aktäa kyühkhyai u lü, “Hin hin Josepa capa am kyakia kya aih se,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hina msuimcäpnak, ‘Sibawi, namät la namät m’yai bea! Ipi Kapenawm khawa pawh hina khaw üng pi pawh lü mdang lawa’ nami ti khai,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, sahma cun amäta khawa am dokhamei khawi u. </char><verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Sang 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Cunsepi ka ning jah mthehki, Elijaha kcün üng, khawkum kthum la khya khyuk khaw am a se, khaw avan üng khaw a set law üng, hmeinu khawjah Isarel khawa awmki he, </char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Sang 17:8-16</ref></char></note> cunsepi ua veia pi Elijah tüiha am kya naw, Sidon khaw da Sarepta khawa hmeinu mata veia ni tüiha akya ve. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Sang 5:1-14</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Acunüng sahma Elishaa kcün üng pi Isarel khawa mnehkse mnehki khawjah awmki he; cunsepi Naman, Siria khawa ka dänga thea upi ngcimsak bea am kya naw,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Acunüng Sinakoka k'uma awmki he ami van acun ami ngjak üng, aktäa ami mlung soki. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Acunüng tho law u lü, mlüh üngka naw ktämki he naw ami mlüha awmnak mcunga khana ami buhtawn vaia ami cehpüi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Cunsepi Jesuh ami ksunga ngjui lü akcea citeiki.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya kse mata Awmnak Khyang Mat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw Kalile mlüh, Kapenawma cit lü Sabbath mhmüp üng a jah mthei. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mt 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note>A ngthu pyen ana a awma phäha aktäa cäicah lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Acunüng Sinakoka k'uma khyang mat ngmüimkhya ksea awmnak awmki cun, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Nazaret Jesuh, i mi nglak awm se ni? Jah mkhyüh khaia na lawki aw? Nang ka ning ksingki, nang Mhnama ngsä ngcima na kyaki ni,” ti lü ngpyangki. <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä khikheh lü a k'um üngka naw lut law,”</char> ti lü jüi se, acunüng khawyai naw khyang hea maa mkhyu lü, ia pi am pawh lü a ceh tak.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Acunüng awmki he ami van naw cäi u lü, “Hin hin ia ngthu ni? Ana la khyaihnak am khawyai kse he jah jüi se lut lawki he hin,” tia ngthäh kyuki he. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Acunüng acuna pipei, khaw avan üng a mawng ngthang hüki.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyang khawjah a jah M’yai be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mt 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Jesuh Sinakok üngka naw ktawih lü Sihmona ima citki. Acuia Sihmona pi aktäa mhnatei se ami mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Jesuh naw a peia ngdüi lü a mhnat jüi se mhnat naw a khyah. Acunüng angxita tho law lü a jah khüih.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Acunüng khaw kya se, natnak akce kcea jah hui, am phetki he avan a veia ami jah lawpüi; acunüng ami vana khana a kut mtaih lü a jah m’yai be. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Khawyai he naw, “Pamhnama Capa na kyaki ni,” tia, ngpyang u lü, khyang khawjaha k'um üngka naw lut lawki he. Acunüng Jesuh naw jah jüi se, Mesijaha kyaki ti ami ksinga phäha am a jah ngthuhei sak.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Sinakoka k'uma Ngthu Pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Khawa thaih law la, Jesuh mlüh ktawi ta lü angkhyinaka cit se, khyang he naw sui u lü a veia law siki he naw, am a jah ceh tak vaia ami khyawh. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Cunsepi Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pung kcea pi Pamhnama khawa mawng thangkdaw ka pyen khaia kyaki, acun vaia tüih lawa ka kyaki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Acunakyase acuna khawaa awmkia Sinakok hea k'uma ngthu sang hüki.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Axüsaw Kcük he a jah khü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mt 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mt 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mk 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note> Khawmhmüp at üng khyang he Pamhnama ngthu ngai khai hea ami ngbum law üng Jesuh Kenesaret tuili kama ngdüi lü, <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>tuili kama mlawng nghngih ve se a hmuh, cunsepi ngaksuie cun acun üngka naw kco u lü ami ngvai he jah mthi khai hea citki he. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Sihmona mlawng mata khana Jesuh kai lü, lawngkam üngka naw ajawha tui da ahei mhnawn vaia a mtheh. Acunüng mlawng üng ngaw lü khyang he a jah mthei.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Acunüng ngthu a pyen law päng üng Sihmona veia, <char style="wj">“Tui alinaka hei mhnawna, na püi he am ngvai vawi u lü nga kpang ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jn 21:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sihmon naw, “Saja aw, amthana vawi u lü, i pi am kami yahki, cunsepi na ngthua kba vawi vang,” ti lü a msang. <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Jn 21:6</ref></char></note>Acunüng vawi u se ami ngvai pi tek hlü hnap khaia nga aktäa kpangki he. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ami püi mlawng kce üng awmki he law u lü ami jah kpüi law vaia ami kut ami hei kha. Acun he law u se mlawng nghngih üng ngcum law hlü ngsai khaia nga ami tak. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Sihmon Pita cun Jesuha khaw kunga kawp lü, “Bawipa aw, kei khyangka ni, na ceh taa,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Nga khawjah ami kpana phäha awm hmaihki he am aktäa cäiki he. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Sihmona püi he bä, Zebedea capa Jakuk la Johan naw pi aktäa ani kyüh. Acunüng Jesuh naw Sihmon üng, <char style="wj">“Ä kyüa, tukbäi üngka naw khyang na kpang khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Acunüng ami mlawnge lawngkama jah kaipüiki he naw, a hmäi ceh ta u lü Jesuh cun ami läk.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyang mat M’yai beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mt 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Jesuh mlüh mata a awm üng khyang mat mnehkse natnak am beki awmki naw Jesuh hmu law lü, mdek üng kawp lü, “Saja aw, na hlüei üng na na ngcimsak be<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12</char><char style="ft" closed="false">na ngcinsak be: Ahina mnehkse naw khyang mtüihkheh sakia ana ngai khawiki he. </char></note> theiki ni,” ti lü a nghüinak.<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Jesuh naw a kut han sängki naw hnet lü, <char style="wj">“Ka hlüeiki ni ngcim lawa,”</char> a ti. Acunüng angxita a mnehkse cun khyük lawki. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref></char></note> Jesuh naw a veia, <char style="wj">“U üng pi ä na mtheh vai, cunsepi ktaiyü üng va ngtengei kyusak lü, Mosia thuma kba khyang hea ksinga na ngcim angsingnak vaia pemsawtnak mat va pawha,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Cunsepi Jesuha mawng cun ngthang hü ksetam se, khyang khawjah a ngthu ami ngai hlüa phäh la, ami natnak he a jah mdaw be vai ami ngaia phäha aktäa ngcun lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Cunsepi Jesuh amät khawkhyawng khawea ktaiyü khaia citeiki.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Akxo mat M’yai beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mt 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Mhmüp mat a jah mthei k'um üng, Kalile, Judah la Jerusalem üngka naw lawki hea Pharise he la, Mosia thum jah mtheikia saja he a peia ngawki he. Acunüng yainak Bawipa a khyaihnak cun a veia awmki. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Khyang avang naw akxo mat a ngjännak üng kawt lawki he naw Jesuha ma tak vaia ami bü. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Khyang däm se, ami luhnakpüi vai am hmu u lü, im khana kaipüiki he naw, im khan üngka naw mkyung kpäk u lü, anglung üng Jesuha ma a ngjänak maha ami ju khyak. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Jesuh naw ami jumnak hmu lü, ka püi aw, <char style="wj">“Na katnak he jah mhlät pänga kya ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Thum ksing he la Pharise he naw ngaikyu u lü, “Hin hin u ni, Pamhnam ksekhanaka ngthu pyenki? Mhnama thea u naw katnak he jah mhlät thei se ni?” tia ng’yüngki he.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Jesuh naw ami ngaihkyunak he jah ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Ivai nami mlung k'uma nami ngaikyuki ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/><char style="wj">“Ini ajäi bawk? Na katnak he jah mhlät pänga kya ve, ti vai aw? Am acunüng tho law lü cita ti vai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi khyanga capa naw khawmdeka khana katnak he jah mhlätnaka ana taki ni ti nami ksingnak vaia,” </char> ti lü, akxo üng, <char style="wj">“Tho law, na ngjänak lo lü na ima cita, ti veng,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Acunla akxo cun ami ma ngdüi law lü, a ngjänak lo lü, Pamhnam mküimto lü, a im lama cit beki. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ami van cäi law u lü, Pamhnam mküimto u lü, kyühnak am be u lü, “Tuhngawi am hmuh khawia cäicahnak mi hmu law ve,” tia, ng’yüngkoki he.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Levih Khüki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mt 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Acunkäna ava ceh üng, ngcawnklawk Levih ngming naki ngcawn lawknaka ngaw se hmu lü, <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Acunüng Levih naw tho law lü ahmäi jah yawk lü a läk. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Acunüng Levih naw a ima, Jesuh khina lü, buh aknuia pawh se, acuia ngcawnklawki he la akce khawjah ngaw hmaihki he. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Lk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref> </char></note>Pharise avang la ca k'yu avang naw Jesuha axüisaw he üng, “Ivai ngcawnklawk he la khyangka he am nami ei hmaihki he ni?” tia ami jah pyen.<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang kphet he naw sibawi am hlü u, am phetki he naw ni sibawi ami hlü. </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/><char style="wj">“Kei khyang ngsungpyune jah khü khaia ka lawkia am kya naw; khyangka he ngjutnaka jah khü khaia ni ka law ve,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ei jeiha Mawng ami Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mt 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Khyang avang naw, “Johana axüisaw he angläta ami ei jeih u lü ktaiyüki he, Pharise hea ami xüisaw he pi acunkba ami ei jeih u lü ktaiyü khawiki he, ise nanga xüisaw he ei awki he ni,” tia, Jesuh ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cambumki a püi he am ami awm hmaiha küt üng, ei nami jah jeihsak thei khai aw? Am jeih u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi cambumkia cangpyang ami vei üngka naw lak lawnaka kcün pha law khai, acuna kcün üng ami ei jeih law khai he,” </char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jesuh naw msuimcäpnak jah mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“U naw jih kthai ktek lü jih kphyüm kpäk üng am kbun khawi u, ami kbun üng akthai tek khai. Ami kbunak akthai la akphyüm am nghlawi khai xawi. </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/><char style="wj">“U naw capyitui asü awi akphyüm üng am than khawi u, ami than üng capyitui asü naw awi akphyüm ütpäk se ngsawi bäih lü awi pi ak khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/><char style="wj">“Capyitui asü awi akthai üng than vai, acunüng va ani nghngih am se khai xawi. </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/><char style="wj">“U naw capyittui akphyüm ami awk käna akthai am ngaih khawi u naw, ‘Akphyüm daw bawki’ ti khawiki he,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sabbatha Suilam ami Kthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mt 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Deut 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sabbath mhmüp üng Jesuh lo hmu lama cit se axüisaw he naw kyung cangvui jah kpyat u lü ami kut am mnawiki he naw ei u se, <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Pharise avang he naw, “Ivai Sabbath mhmüp üng am nghlawiki nami pawhki ni?” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3,4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Davit a ei cawi law lü, a püi he am i ami pawh am nami kheh khawiki aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pamhnama ima lut lü, ktaiyüe däng naw ami ei ngkawi muk lo lü, ei lü, a püi he üng pi a jah pet cen,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga capa hin Sabbatha bawi ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akutxo Khyang Mat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mt 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Sabbath akce üng Sinakoka lut lü a jah mthei. Acunüng khyang mat a kut kpat lam xoki awmki. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Thum ksing he la Pharise he avang naw ami mkateinak vaia, Sabbath mhmüp üng mdaw law be khai aw tia a peia awm u lü ami mcih. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Jesuh naw ami ngaihkyunak jah ksingki naw akutxo üng, <char style="wj">“Tho law lü maa lawa”</char> ti se, akxo cun tho law lü ngdüiki. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Mat ka ning jah kthäh khai. Sabbath mhmüp üng kpüi vai aw angkawih? Kpyeh vai aw angkawih? Xünak küikyan vai aw angkawih? Kpyeh vai aw angkawi?” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Acunüng ami van jah teng law päng lü; akxo üng, “Na kut sänga” ti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti: Avang naw mlung sonak am ami ti</char></note> se, acunkba a säng la vanglama ka kba a kut daw law beki.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Acunüng ami mlung naw jah uimsoei se ikba Jesuh ami pawh vaia ngthäh kyuki he.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Axüisaw Xaleinghngih he a jah Xü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mt 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Acunüng, Jesuh ktaiyü khaia mcunga ktawih lü, Pamhnama veia mthai mhlän lü ktaiyüki. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Khaw athaih law la axüisaw he a veia jah khü lü, xaleinghngih ngsä hea a jah xü he cun, <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Pitaa a sui Sihmon la a na Andru; Jakuk la Johan, Philip la Batolame, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mahte la Thomah, Alaphaha capa Jakuk, Patriot naki Sihmon, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Jakuka ca Judah la Jesuh ceng lawkia Judah Iskarota kyaki he.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw jah Mthei lü a jah M’yai be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mt 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Jesuh a ngsä he am mcung üngka naw ami kyum law be üng, a donak üng axüisaw he khawjah am ngdüiki he. Acuia khyang khawjah, Judah khaw avan üngka he la, Jerusalem üngka he, Turah la Sidon mlüh lam tuikam üngka khyang khawjah; <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>a ngthu ngai khai he la ami natnak a jah mdaw be vaia law hüki he. Acunüng ngmüimkhya kse hea jah pawhe pi law u se a jah mdaw be. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>A vei üngka naw khyaibahnak lut law lü jah yai sak se, khyang avan naw ami hnet vaia ktha naki he.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jekyainak la Mlung Natnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mt 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Jesuh naw axüisaw he jah teng lü,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">“M'yenkseki he aw nami jo sen ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">Pamhnama khaw nami hama kyaki! </char><verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi atuh nami ei nami cawiki nami jo sen ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">nami ei nami phü law khaia kyaki! </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi atuh nami mbawikyapki he nami jo sen ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">nami yaiyüng law khaia kyaki! </char><verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Pit 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capaa phäha khyang he naw ning jah hneng u lü, ning jah jüi u lü nami ngming am dawki ti u lü ami ning jah yawk üng nami jo senki! </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Khro 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Ngs 7:52</ref> </char></note><char style="wj">“Jekyai u lü, hlim u lü, nglam ua, khankhawa nami ngkhengnak vai khawjah awmki. Acukba ami pupa he naw sahma hea khana ana pawh khawiki he ni. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Cunsepi atuh nami bawimangki he nami jo se ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">hlimnak nami yah pängkia kyaki! </char><verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi atuh nami phüki nami jo se ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">nami cawi law khaia kyaki! </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi atuh nami yaiyüngkie nami jo se ve; </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">ktha se lü nami mbawikyap law khaia kyaki! </char><verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Khyang he naw ami ning jah mhlünmtai üng nami jo se ve; ami pupa he naw sahma kcang he am niki he khana acunkba ana pawh khawiki he ni.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ye Jawngnak vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mt 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka ngthu ngjaki he aw, nami ye jawng na u lü ning jah hnengkie ami dawnak vaia pawh u.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/><char style="wj">“Ning jah yünceki he josenak am jah kbe u lü ning jah mkhuimkhaki he jah ktaiyü pe u.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/><char style="wj">“Nami ngbeng vanglam ning jah kbeiki üng vanglam pi dunei pe u, acunüng nami jih ning jah lawhei peki am nami kcu a lawhei vaia pi ä nami mkhyawh vai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/><char style="wj">“Ning jah kthäheiki üng pe u lü nami ka ning jah lawhei peki ä kthäh be u.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><char style="wj">“Khyang naw nami khana akdaw a pawh vai nami ngjak hlüa kba khyanga khana akdaw pawh ua. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ning jah jawng naki däng nami jawngnak be üng ngkhengnak i nami yah khai ni? Khyangka he naw pi jah jawng naki cun jawng na beki he ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng nami khana dawki hea veia däng nami daw be üng ngkhengnak i nami yah khai ni? Khyangka he naw pi acunkba cui pawh hngaki he ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/><char style="wj">“Ning jah thung be thei khai däng üng yah be vaia ngak'uheinak am iyaw nami kpu üng ngkhengnak i nami yah khai ni? Khyangka he naw pi yah be vaia ngak'uhnak am khyangka he üng jah kpu hngaki he ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>“Cunsepi nami ye he jah jawng na u lü ami dawnak vai pawh u lü jah kpu ua, acunkba nami pawh üng ngkhengnak nami yah be vai ä ngai ua. Acunüng Akhlüng säih Mhnama ca hea nami kya khai. Mhnam cun bänak am ksingki la am dawki hea veia pi m'yeneinak taki ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase nami Pa m'yeneinak am a bea kba khyang m'yenei hnga ua. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang ä ngthumkhya pet vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mt 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khyang ä nami jah ngthumkhya pet vai, acunüng ngthumkhyanak am am nami awm khai; ä nami jah mkatei vai, acunüng mkateinak am am nami awm khai; jah mhlät u, acunüng mhlätnak am nami awm hnga khai, </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/><char style="wj">“Khyang üng pe u, Pamhnam naw ning jah pe be khai. Akcanga kbäi dänga ä kyase hnawm u lü, khyün u lü, pyep khaia ning jah pe khai he. Nami kbäinak bä am Mhnam naw ning jah kbäi pe be khaia kyaki” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mt 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng Jesuh naw msuimcäpnak mat ami veia pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Amikmü naw, amikmü cehpüi thei khai aw? Amikmü naw a cehpüi üngta ani nghngih khuia k'uma am kya khai xawi aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ngtheiki cun mtheikia kthaka am kyäp bawk naw, upi ami ngthei käna jah mtheikia mäih ni ami law kawm. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ivaia nami mäta mik üng thingmtawn awmki am ngai u lü, nami bena mik üngka mik ek cun nami hmuh ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/><char style="wj">“Ikba nami mäta mik üngka thingmtawn am hmuei u lü na benaa mik üngka ‘Na mik ek ning lawh pe vang’ nami ti thei ni?’ Hypocrit he, akcüka nami mäta mik üngka thingmtawn loei ma u lü, acunüng nami benaa mik üngka mik ek nami lawh pet vaia angsinga nami hmu khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thing la a Ktheih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mt 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Thing kdaw naw akse am ngtheih khawi naw, thing kse pi akdawa am ngtheih khawi naw. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mt 12:33</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Thing avan a ktheih üng ksinga kyaki. Khyang u naw nghling kpyap üng ktheih am kbit khawi u, u naw kpyap üng capyit am kbit khawi u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khyang kdaw naw akdaw a mlungmthin üngka akdaw mhluh law khawiki; khyang kse naw akse a mlungmthin üngka akse mhluh law khawiki. Isetiakyaküng a mlungmthin üng beki a mka naw a pyen khawia kyaki. </char><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imksa Nghngih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mt 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ivai ka ning jah mtheh am bi u lü, ‘Bawipa, Bawipa’ tia nami na khüki ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/><char style="wj">“Khyang ka veia law lü ka ngthu ngai lü ka ngthua kba awmki avan cun u am tängki tia kyak üng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/><char style="wj">lunga khana angkyunga co lü imsaki am tängki ni. Tui däm law lü tui naw acuna im cun tu law se pi lunga khana saka kyase am ngsün lü awmki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/><char style="wj">“Ka ngthu ngja lü ka ngthua kba am awmki cun, akhängnak am awmki, mdeka khana imksa am tängki. Tui däm law lü tui naw acuna im cun tu law se angxita kyu lü avan pyehki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Romah Ngvaia M'ya M'yai beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mt 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Jesuh naw ngthu pyen law päng lü Kapenawma citki. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Acunüng Romah ngvai naw a jawngnaka m'ya mat thi law hlü khaia a mhnat awmki. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Jesuha mawng a ngjak üng, a m'ya mdaw law be khaia, Jesuh va nghui na u lü, khü khai hea, Judah ngvai he a jah tüih. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Jesuha veia law u lü aktäa nghui naki he naw, “Hina khyang ta na kpüi vaia ngkawi ve, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>ani cun mi khyang he jah jawng na lü, Sinakok pi jah sak peki ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Acuna Jesuh ami veia citki. Acunüng a pha law tawm tawm la Romah ngvai naw a püi he jah tüi lü, “Bawipa aw, ka im na luhnak ngkawi vaia am kya ve, ä kha heia, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>acunakyase, na veia ka law vaia pi ka ngkawikia am ngai kyu veng, ngthu däng pyen lü, ka m'ya daw be khai ni. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>“Isetiakyaküng, kei haw anaa takia keha ka awmki. Ka keha yekap he awmki he, mat am ‘cita’ ka ti üng citki, akce mat am ‘lawa’ ka ti üng lawki, ka m'ya am hin pawha ka ti üng pawhki,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Jesuh naw acun a ngjak üng, cäieiki naw, mang hü lü, amät läkia khyang he üng, <char style="wj">“Isarel he üng pi ahikba sena jumeiki am hmu khawi nawng,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>A khyang tüihe ima ami ceh be üng, m'ya cun daw be se ami hmuh.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Hmeinu mata Ca Mxün beki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Acun käna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Acun käna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang üng A ngawi üng tia ng’yuki. </char></note> Jesuh Nai ami tia mlüha cit se, axüisaw he la khyang khawjah a veia cit hngaki he. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Mlüh mkawt pei a pha law üng, hmeinu naw mat däng a canak, khyang kthi ami yawknak kawt law u se, mlüh üngka he khawjah law hngaki he. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Acunüng, Bawipa naw acuna hmeinu a hmuh üng, m'yenei leng leng lü, <char style="wj">“Ä kyapa”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Jesuh naw law lü, yawkkawng hnet se, kawtki he ngdüiki he. Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cawngpyang, tho law, ti veng,” </char>ti se, <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>akthi cun tho law lü ngthuhei law se, Jesuh naw a nu üng a pet.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Acunüng, ami van kyü lawki he naw, Pamhnam mküimto u lü, “Mi ksunga sahma akyäp awm law ve; Pamhnam a khyang he jah küikyan khaia law ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Acuna Jesuha mawng cun khaw avan la a pipeia hne avan üng ngthang hüki.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johan naw a jah Tüiha Khyang he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mt 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Johana axüisaw he naw acuna mawng avan cun Johan üng ami mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Acunüng, Johan naw axüisaw nghngih jah khüki naw, Bawipa veia jah tüi lü, “Johan naw law khai a tia khyanga na kyaki aw? Akce kami na äpei khai aw?” tia a jah va kthähsak. <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Acunüng, Jesuh veia law u lü, “Law khai mata na kyaki aw? Akce kami na äpei khai aw? tia ni kthäh vaia baptican Johan naw na veia a jah tüih law ni,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Acunapät üng Jesuh naw, a jah huieie, natnak khihlau akce kcea jah awmnak he, ngmüimkhya ksea awmnak he khawjah jah mdaw be lü, amikmü khawjah a jah mdeisak be. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Hesa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Hesa 61:1</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Citbe u lü, nami hmuh la nami sim he Johan üng jah va mtheh ua; amikmüe mdei law be ve u, akhawkxo he ami khaw am cit ve u, mnehkse mnehkie ngcim be ve u, ami nghnga kpangki he pi ami nghnga ngjang be ve u, akthi he xüng law be ve u, khuikha m’yetsekiea veia thangkdaw sanga kya ve. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/><char style="wj">“Upi, keia phäha, a mlung am hlawtlatki ta a jo sen ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Johana xüisaw he ami ktawih be käna, Jesuh naw Johana mawng khyang he üng jah mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“Johana veia, khawkhyawng khawa nami ceh üng, i teng khaia ni nami ceh? Khawkhia aksün khuhlip teng khaia aw nami ceh? </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/><char style="wj">“Am acunüng i teng khaia ni nami ceh? Suisak akdaw suisaki teng khaia aw nami ceh? Suisak akdaw suisaki he cun sangpuxang hea ima ni ami awm khawi. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/><char style="wj">“Am acunüng sahma teng khaia aw nami ceh? Ä, ka ning jah mtheki, sahmaa kthaka pi kyäp bawki hia awm ve, </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">cangcim naw ‘Ngaia ka khyang na ma ka tüih, ani naw na maa lam pyang khai’ tia a mawng ami yuk cen ahina Johan ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, nghnumi hea ca avan üng Johana kyäp bawki sahma am awm naw; cunsepi, Pamhnama khawa akjaw säih pi Johana kthaka kyäp bawki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29,30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mt 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, khyang avan naw ami ngjak; aktunga ngcawnklawk he cun Pamhnama ngsungpyunak vaia Johana baptican khanki he. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Cunsepi, Pharise he la, thum mksingki he naw, ami hama Pamhnama pyan ma u lü, Johana baptican ä khanki he.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Jesuh naw pyen be tü lü, <char style="wj">“Tuhkbäiha ngsawn he hin i am ni ka jah msuimcäp kawm? Ia mäih ni ami law? </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/><char style="wj">“Ahin he cun Anghmawe jawihtuknaka ngawki he, ngkhü kyu u lü, ‘Cambumak pülün ning jah tum pe ung se am nami nglamki, yawk la sa ung se pi am nami kyapki’ ti am tängki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/><char style="wj">“Baptican Johan a law üng ei nghmü lü capyitui am aw se, ‘khawyaia awmnak’ nami tiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/><char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa law lü ei aw se, ‘Teng u, eiaw aih ve, ngcawnklawk he la khyang kse hea püi cen’ nami tiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/><char style="wj">“Mhnama ksingkhyapnak cun dokhameiki he naw a cangnak mdangki he ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Pharise Sihmona Ima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Pharise mat naw a veia buh ei khaia khü se, Jesuh Pharisea ima lut lü buh ei khaia ngawki. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37,38</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mt 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note>Acuna mlüh üng nghnumi kse mat awmki naw Pharisea ima Jesuh buh ei lü awmki ti, a ksing üng, alabasta um üng situi ngui lawpüiki naw, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Jesuha hnu, a khaw kunga kyap lü ngdüiki. A miktui naw a khawpha msüi se, a lusam am xüt lü, a khawpha mhnamki naw, situi ng'ui am a hluk. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Pharise naw hmu lü, a mlung k'uma, “Hin hin sahma kcanga a kya vai sü, hnetkia nghnuminu hin u ni, ia mäih ni ti ksing khai sü. Khyangka kyalang se,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sihmon, na veia ngthu mat ka pyen vai awm ve,” ti lü a msang. Acunüng Sihmon naw, “Saja aw pyena,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ngui jah kpuki, mat naw, khyang nghngih üng ngui a jah kpu; mat üng phya mhma a kpu, mat am mhmakip a kpu. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/><char style="wj">“Ani thungnak be vai am ta ni se, ani nghngih a jah mhlät. Acunüng, acun xawi üng u naw jawng na bawk khai ni?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Sihmon naw, “A mhlät däm naw jawng na bawk khaia ngai veng,” ti lü, msang se, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cang veki,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Acunüng, nghnumi nghlat si lü, Sihmona veia, <char style="wj">“Hina nghnuminu na hmuki aw? Na ima lut law ni se, ka khaw ka mthinak vaia tui am na na peki, hina nghnuminu naw a miktui am ka khaw mthi lü, a lusam am xütki.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/><char style="wj">“Nang naw am na na mhnamki, hina nghnumi naw ka luh law üng tün lü ka khawpha am pyai lü mhnamki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/><char style="wj">“Nang naw ka lü situi am na hluki, hina nghnumi naw ka khawpha situi am hluki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ning mtheh veng, aktäa jawng nakia kyase, a katnak he khawjah cun mhlät pänga kya ve. A katnak ajaw däng mhlät naw ajawha jawng naki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw nghnumi üng, <char style="wj">“Na katnak he jah mhlät pänga kya ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Buh a eipüi he naw, “Katnak pi jah mhlätki hin u ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw nghnumi üng, <char style="wj">“Na jumnak naw ning küikyan ve, dim’yenak am cita,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Ngkhahpüikia Nghnumi he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Akäna Jesuh naw, mlüh he, ngnam he üng cit hü lü Pamhnama khawa mawng thangkdaw sang hü se, xaleinghngih he pi a veia citki he. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2,3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mt 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mk 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lk 23:49</ref></char></note>Acunüng, nghnumi he khawyaia awmnak daw beki he la, natnak üngka naw yai beki he pi awmki he. Acuna nghnumi he cun, a k'um üngka naw khawyai khyüh lut lawkia Makdalin ami ti Marih naki, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Heroda khawhthem mceiki Joanah, Cuza a khyu, Susanah la, amimäta ka am Jesuh tumbeiki hea nghnumi kce hea kyaki he.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mciksaw am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Mlüh mat ngpäng se mat üngka khyang he law hü u lü, ngbum law u se, Jesuh naw, msuimcäpnak am ngthu jah mtheh lü,<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mciksaw, mci saw khaia loa citki, acunüng a saw k'um üng avang lam üng kya se khyang he naw ami leh, kha he naw ami ei.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>“Mci avang lunga danaka khana kyaki a pyo law la mdek ä ngsüikia kyase ng’yawngei bäihki. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/><char style="wj">“Mci avang nghlinghmua kyaki, nghling naw pyo lawpüi lü a mthihin. </char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, avang ngleihkdaw üng kyaki, pyo law lü, aphya a, vuipai lawki,” </char>a ti. Acunüng, acun a pyen law päng üng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami ngjaknak vaia nami nghnga a ve üng ngja ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msuimcäpnaka Suilam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mt 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Axüisaw he naw, “Hina msuimcäpnaka suilam hin i ni?” tia kthäh u se, <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Hesa 6:9</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi cun Pamhnama khankhawa mawng ksingnak ning jah peta kyaki, cunsepi avanga veia msuimcäpnak am pyena kyaki, ‘Teng u se pi am hmu kcangki he, ngja u se pi am ksingki he.’ </char><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Msuimcäpnak Pyen Khaiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Msuimcäpnak cun hinkba kyaki; Mci cun Mhnama ngthua kyaki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/><char style="wj">“Lam kpema kyaki he cun ngthu ngjaki he, am jumei u lü küikyana am ami kyanak vaia, khawyai naw law lü ami mlungmthin üngka ngthu cun a lawhei. </char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/><char style="wj">“Lunga khana kyaki he cun, ngthu ngja u lü jekyainak am dokhameiki hea kyaki, cunsepi ami pya am awmse, asäng jumki he te hlawhlepnak a pha law üng kyukngtängeiki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>“Nghling hmua kyaki he cun, ngthu ngjaki he; cunsepi khawmdek cäicahnak, bawimangnak, hlimtuinak he naw jah bawngkha sak se am vüipai law thei u. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, ngleih kdawa khana kyaki he cun, ngthu cun ngja u lü, ami mlung khyawnga ta u lü, mtheh ngjaknaka mlungmthin am ami ngtheipai vei cäpa biloki he.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kphya am Müka Meiim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11:33</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“U naw meiim mdäi lü kphya am am mük khawi u, ihnaka keha pi am thup khawi u, lutki avan naw akvai ami hmuh vaia, taknak ngkawi üng ta khawiki he. </char><verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12:2</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Ipi ä ngphyeh khaia mjih ngphyeh law lü, ipi ä ngdang khaia thup ngdang law lü akvainaka law püia kya law khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mt 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19:26</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ikba nami ngjak cäiei na ua; upi taki üng petsih u lü, upi am taki cun a takca a ngaih pi yuh pet vai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Nu la a Bena he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mt 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Jesuh a nu la, a bena he a veia lawki he, khyang dämkia kyase a peia am pha u se, <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>“Na nu la na bena he ning hmu khaia bü u lü, kpunga ngdüi ve u,” tia ami mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hina Pamhnama ngthu ngai u lü, kcang naki he hin, ka nu la ka bena he ni,” </char> ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khawkhi kse Ngdümsaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mt 8:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Khaw mhmüp mat cun axüisaw he am mlawng üng ami awm üng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Lia, cayea, mi va pek vai u,” </char> a ti. Acunüng citki he. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Ami ceh k'um üng Jesuh ipeiki; acunüng tuili üng khaw khi law sawxat lü, ami mlawng tui am be law se kyü u lü, khuikhaki he. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Axüisaw he a veia citki he naw mtho u lü, “Saja aw, Saja aw, khyük law hlü ve üng” ami ti. Acunüng Jesuh naw tho law lü, khawkhi la tuiyüi jah jüi se, pyai lü ngdüm lawki. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami jumnak hawia ni?”</char> a ti. Acunsepi kyü u lü, cäicah lawki he naw, “Hin hin u ni? Khawkhi la tuiyüi naw pi ngthu jah pe se, ani ngaih?” tia ng’yüngkoki he.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khawyaia awmnak Khyang mat M’yaiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mt 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Jesuh la axüisaw he Kalile üngka naw tuili üng ngtäi u lü Kerasa khawa citki he. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Jesuh ava kco la, khawyai naw khawvei a awmnak, suisak am suisaki, ima am awm lü ng’uhnün he cia awmkia khyang mat naw ana khyum. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Acunüng, Jesuh a hmuh la, a maa kyu lü, angsanga, “Jesuh, ak'hlüng säih Mhnama Capa, ikba na na pawh hlüki ni? Ä na mkhuimkhaa, ning huina veng,” ti lü ngpyangki. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Isetiakyaküng, Jesuh naw khawyai acuna khyang üngka naw cit khaia ngthu ana pet khawia phäha kyaki. Acuna khyang cun khawyai naw a man khawia kyaki; mthiyüi am a kutkhaw he jah pin u lü thawngim üng ami khyum üngpi ami pinpawknak he jah tipat lü mawkpyawnga dawng khaia khawyai naw a pawh khawia kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na ngming u ni?” </char>ti lü kthäh se, khawyai naw, “Ka ngming cun apä ni,” a ti, (isetiakyaküng, a k'uma khawyai khawjah a luha phäha kyaki). <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Acunüng, khui kthuknua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Khui kthuknu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khawyai he jah mkhuimkhanak anghnu säih am a pha law ham üng mce k’uma jah ktawk vai tia ngtheinak awmki </char></note> am a jah tüih vaia ami nghuinak.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Acunüng, mkyanga vawk khawjah ami jah mcaha k'uma ami luhnak vaia Jesuh nghuina u se, Jesuh naw a jah pet. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Khawyai he khyanga khui üngka naw lut law u lü, vawka k'uma lut u se, vawk he kdanga dawng u lü, tui üng ngcumki he.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Vawksäm he naw ami hmu üng, dawng u lü, ngnamthe la loa ami va sang. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Acunüng, ia akya, teng khai hea nghlawm u lü citki he, acuia Jesuha veia ami pha law üng, khawyai hea cehtak cun Jesuha khaw kunga suisa lü ngaikyunak akdaw am ngaw se ami hmu üng, aktäa kyüki he. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Acun hmuki he naw anghnua lawki he üng acuan khyang ihawkba a yai be ami jah mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Acunüng acuna khaw pipei üngka he ami van kyü law u lü, ami khaw üngka naw angxita a ktawih be vaia ami nghuinak. Acunüng, Jesuh mlawng üng lut lü cit beki. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Khawyaia, a cehtaka khyang naw, Jesuh veia a ceh ngha vaia nghuina se, Jesuh naw, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Na ima nghlat be lü, <char style="wj">Pamhnam naw aktäa, i na hama a ning pawh pet jah va mtheha,” </char>ti lü, a tüih be.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Acunüng mlüh üng cit lü, Jesuh naw a hama a pawh peta a hlüngtaia mawng cun sang hüki.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jairuha Canu la a Thiputkia Nghnumi naw Jesuha Kcu ani Hnet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mt 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Jesuha tuili acayea a nghlat law be üng, khyang he naw ana ngängki he naw, aktäa ami na jekyainak. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Acunüng, Sinakoka ngvai mat Jairuh naki lawki, Jesuha khaw kunga kawp lü, a ima cit khaia a nghuinak law. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Mat däng a canak nghnumica, kum xaleinghngih lawki, thi law hlü ngsaikia a kuna phäha kyaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Acunüng Jesuh a ceh k'um üng khyang he naw ami kcung. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Acunüng, nghnumi mat, kum xaleinghngih a thi putki, a ngui tak avan seibawi hea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ngui tak avan seibawi hea veia a ngsawieinak bäih </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tia avang üng am awm.</char></note> veia a ngsawieinak bäih, acunüng u naw pi am ami mdaw be thei, <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Jesuha hnua law lü, a suisak mdawngca hnet law se, acun la angxita a thi put ye beki. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U ni na hnetki?” </char>a ti. Acunüng, “Kei ta am ni nawng,” ti u se, Pita naw, “Saja aw, khyang he naw ning kcung na u lü ning hnet ye u se” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Cunsepi, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U yaw naw ta na hnetki ni, johit ka khui üngka naw lut law se sim veng”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Nghnumi naw, ä ngthup theiki ti ksing lü, a ngkhet maha law lü, Jesuha maa kawp lü, a hneta suilam la, a daw be ngxita mawng cun, khyang avana hmuha, a phyeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka canu aw, na jumnak naw ning dawsak be ve, dim'yenak am cita,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Acukba ana ngthuhei k'um üng, Sinakok ngvaia im üngka naw khyang mat law lü, “Saja ä kbawng kbaia, na canu thi päng ve,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Acun Jesuh naw a ngjak üng msang lü, <char style="wj">“Ä cäia, a jum dänga mah juma, na canu daw be khai ni,</char>” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Acunüng, Jesuh ima law lü, Pita, Jakuk, Johan la, hnasena nu la pa dänga thea, upi im k'uma am a jah luhsak.<verse eid="LUK 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ami van aktäa ana mbawikyap u se Jesuh naw jah hmu lü, <char style="wj">“Ä kyap ua, hnasen am thiki ni, ipki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Acuna thi pängkia ksingki he naw ami yaihei. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Cunsepi Jesuh naw nghnumica cun a kut üng manki naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ca aw, tho law,”</char> ti lü, a khü. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Acunüng, a xünak naw kpan law be se, angxita tho law beki. Acunüng, Jesuh naw ei vai iyaw ami pet vaia a jah mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Acunüng, a nu la a pa aktäa cäi lawki xawi, Jesuh naw a bilawh u am pi am ani jah mtheh vaia a jah ksük.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Axüisaw he Xaleinghngih a jah Tüih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mt 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw axüisaw he xaleinghngih atänga jah khü lü, khawyai he avan jah mkhütnaka johit la natnak he jah m'yainak be theinak jah pe lü, <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Pamhnama khawa mawng sang hü khai he la, am phetki he jah m’yai be khai hea a jah tüih. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10:4-11</ref></char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami cehnaka ipi ä nami cehei vai, ksawngkhea pi kyase, kthäheinaka ngjaa pi kyase, eia pi kyase, nguia pi kyase, ä nami cehei vai, kcu nghngih ä nami cehei vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng nami phanaka ima nami awm laih laih vai, acun üngka naw nami ktawih be vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ngs 13:51</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Am ning jah dokhamki cun, acuna mlüh üngka naw nami ktawih be üng, ami ngsingnak vaia nami khawpha üngka mvut nami khawk hüt vai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Acunüng axüisaw he cun ktawih u lü, ngnam naküta cit hü u lü, thangkdaw sang hü u lü, hmün naküt üng ami jah m’yai hü be.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod Cäiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mt 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7,8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Kalile uki Herod naw ahmäi ngja law lü aktäa cäi lawki; avang he naw, “Baptican Johan xüng law beki ni,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Avang naw, “Elijah ngdang lawki ni,” ti u se, avang he naw, “Ajana sahma mat mat xüng law beki he ni” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Acunüng, Herod naw, “Johan cun a lu ka xün päng ni, ahikba sena a mawng ka ngjak hin u ni?” a ti. Acunüng Herod naw Jesuh a hmuh vai aktäa ngjahlüki.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyang Thawng Mhma jah Mbeiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Acunüng, ngsä he law be u lü, ami bilawh he Jesuh üng ami jah mtheh law. Acunüng, Jesuh naw jah ngkhahpüi lü Bethsaida mlüh ami tia, a jah cehpüi. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Cunsepi, khyang he naw sim u lü, ami läk laih laih, acunüng Jesuh naw aktäa jah dokham lü, Pamhnama khawa mawng ngthu jah mtheki naw, m’yai be vai avan a jah m’yai be.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Acunüng, nghngi kya law hlü se, xaleinghngih he Jesuha veia law u lü, “Khyang he mi peisu ngnam he la loea jah tüia, ngsutnak la ei vai hmuei khai hea, hina mäih khawkhyawng khawa mi awm ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw ami ei vai jah pe ua,” </char>a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Acunüng axüisaw he naw, “Muk mhma la nga nglung nghngih ni kami tak. Hin he avana hama, ei vai kami va kheih vai ti aih lü? ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Kpami däng pi thawng mhma lawki hea kyaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Acunüng Jesuh naw, axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Mhmakip cia, aphäh phäha jah ngawhsak u,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Acunüng acunkba ami van ami jah ngawhsak. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Jesuh naw muk mhma la nga nglung nghngih lo lü, khankhawa hang mang lü, josenak am kbe lü, boki naw, khyang hea maa, ami tak vaia axüisaw he üng a jah pet. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Acunüng, ami van naw ei u lü phü u se, ami ei mnawi cä xaleinghngiha ami kaw.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuha Kyanak Pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mt 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Acunüng hinkba kyaki, Jesuh amät ktaiyü se, axüisaw he a veia lawki he, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyang he naw ua ni ami na ngaih,”</char> ti lü a jah kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mt 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, axüisaw he naw, “Baptican Johana ning ngai ve u; cunsepi, avang naw, ‘Elijaha’ ning ngai ve u, avang naw, ‘Akphyüma sahma mat mat xüng law beki ni’ ti ve u,” tia ami msang.<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acuna akyaküng, nangmi naw mä ua ni nami na ngaih,” </char>a ti. Pita naw, “Nang cun Mhnama Mesijah ni” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a Khuikhanak vai la a Thihnak vai Pyenki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mt 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mk 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Acunüng, upi acuna mawng ä ami mtheh vaia a jah ksük. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga capa naw aktäa khuikhanak khamei khai, angvai he, ktaiyü ngvai he la thum ksing he naw ma khai he, hnima kya khai, amhmüp kthum üng tho law be khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, ami vana veia, <char style="wj">“Upi na läk law khai ngaiki naw amät ä ngaikyu lü, a kutlamktung amhmüp tä se kawt lü na läk law se.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Upi a xünnak küikyanei khai büki naw mkhyüh lü, upi keia phäha, a xünnak mkhyühki naw küikyanei khai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/><char style="wj">“Khyang naw khawmdek avan ka na lü, amät la amät pyeh se, am acunüng xükse, ia ni a ngmangnak kawm?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/><char style="wj">“Upi, kei la ka ngthu ngkekhyakei naki cun, khyanga Capa naw, a pa hlüngtainak, amäta hlüngtainak la khankhawngsä ngcim he am a law be üng, ngkekhyakei na be khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, hin üng ngdüiki he avang, Pamhnama khaw am ami hmuh hlana küt üng am thi khai he awmki he”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Hngalangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mt 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Pit 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Acuna ngthu a pyen kän amhmüp khyet üng, Pita, Johan la Jakuk jah ngkhahpüi lü, ktaiyü khaia mcunga kaiki. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>A ktaiyü k’um üng, a hmai hnga law lü, a suisak he a ktäa bawk law lü ngkah lawki. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Acunüng, khyang nghngih Jesuh am ngthuheiki xawi, acun kxawi cun Mosi la Elijaha kyaki xawi, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>khankhaw hlüngtai kyäpsawknak suiawi ni lü, Jerusalema a khuikhanak vaia mawng pyenki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Acunüng, Pita la a püi he ipeiki he let law u lü, a hlüngtainak la a peia khyang nghngih ngdüiki xawi ami jah hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Acun xawi naw Jesuh ani ktawih law hlü tak üng, Pita naw i a pyen ä ksingei lü Jesuh üng, “Saja aw, hia awm hin daw ve, na hama mat, Mosia hama mat, Elijaha hama mat samca kthum kami sa khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Acukba a pyen k’um üng khawngmei naw jah msungin law se, axüisaw he kyü lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Hesa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char></note>Ngmei üng “Hin hin ka xüa ka Capa ni, a ngthu ngai u,” tia ngthu ngthang lawki.<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Acunüng, ngthu a ngdüm la, Jesuh amät däng ami hmuh. Axüisaw he cun am khikheh u lü, ami hmuha mawng cun, acuna pät üng u üng pi am mtheh u.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khawyaia Awmnak hnasen M’yai beki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mt 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>A ngawi üng mcung üngka naw axüisaw kthum am kyum be u se, khyang khawjah naw ami na khyum. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Acunüng, khyang hea ksunga khyang mat ngpyang lü, “Saja aw, amät däng ka canak ka capa teng law, ning hui na veng. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>“Khawyai naw man khawi se, ngpyangin sawxat xatki, a mci mvawn pi kya law khaia pawh lü mdek üng a kyuk sak khawi, acunkba mkhuimkha lü am ceh hlü ta. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>“Acunüng, na xüisaw he üng ami ktäm vaia jah nghui na ni se, amimi naw pi ani cun am ami ktäm thei,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Jumnak am ta lü, üpnak am awmkia khyang he, nami veia ivei ka awm khai aw? Ivei ka ning jah msawk vai aw?” </char> ti lü, acuna khyang üng, <char style="wj">“Na ca hia lawpüia,” </char>ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Acunüng, hnasen a law k'um üng, khawyai naw khawmdek khana kyuk sak lü, aknaa a pawh. Cunsepi, Jesuh naw, khawyai kse jüi lü, anghmaw mdaw beki naw a pa üng a pet. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Acunüng, khyang avan naw Pamhnama hlüngtainak cun aktäa kyühkhyai lawki he.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jesuh naw a Thih vai Pyen beki</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mt 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ami van naw acunkba, a bilawh he ami kyühkhyai law üng, Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheh hlü ä mhnih u; Khyanga Capa, khyang hea kut üng mansak vai ng'et law ve,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Cunsepi, a ngthu pyena suilam cun am ami ksing, ami ksing vaia mjiha kyaki, ami kthäh vaia pi ami kyüh.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">U Kyäp Säihki?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mt 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, u kyäp säih khai tia amimät he ana ngcuh hü u se, <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Jesuh naw ami ngaikyunak jah ksing lü, hnasenca mat kai lü, a peia taki naw, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Upi hina hnasenca, ka ngming üng dokhamki cun, kei na dokhamki ni, acunüng u pi, kei na dokhamki cun, kei na tüi lawki pi dokhamki ni. Nangmi üng jaw säihki, acun cen kyäp säih khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am ning jah Hnengki cun Nami Püi ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Acunüng Johan naw, “Saja aw, khyang mat naw na ngming am khawyai he jah ktäm se kami hmuh, keimi üngka am nikia kyase am a pawh ti vaia kami kpyai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä kpyai ti ua, u pi nangmi am ning jah hnengki cun nami püia kyaki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samarih khyang he naw Jesuh am ami Ngjakhlü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Acunüng, khankhawa a cehnak vai ng'et law se, Jerusalema a ceh vai lingki. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Ngsä he a ma a jah na tüih. Acunüng, ana dawng u lü, ana ngtün pe khai hea Samarih khaw mata lutki he. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Jerusalema cit khaia a büa phäha Samarih khyang he naw am a na dokham u. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Sang 1:9-16</ref></char></note>Acunüng, axüisaw xawi Johan la Jakuk naw acun ani ksing la, “Bawipa aw, hin he ami ngkhihnak bäih vaia, khankhawa mei han khü vaia na ngjahlüki aw?” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Avang üng Elijah naw a pawha kba tia ami mkhah si. </char></note>tia ani kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ani veia nghlat law lü, a jah jüih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang üng, “</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ia Ngmüimkhya naw a ning jah awmnak am ksing ve niki; Khyanga Capa hin kpyükpyeh khaia am law lü küikyan khaia ni a law ve” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tia ami mkhah si. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Acunüng ngnam kcea citki he.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami läk vai Ngjahlüki he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mt 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Lam ami ceh k'um üng khyang mat naw, “Na cehnak avana ka ning läk khai,” ti lü Jesuh a mtheh,<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sauie naw khui ta u lü, kha he naw pi ngbu taki he, khyanga Capa naw ta a lu a khännak vai la a xüieinak vai pi am ta ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw khyang kcea veia, <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa,” </char>a ti. Cunsepi ani naw, “Bawipa aw, cit be lü ka pa va k'ut hüt ma vang,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyangkthi he naw amimät akthi k'utei u se; nang ta Pamhnama khawa mawng ngthu va sanga,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Sang 19:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Akce naw pi, “Saja aw, ka ning läk law khai; cunsepi, ka im üngka he, ngthukdaw am jah va ngkhyahpüi ma vang,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“Upi, lai thawn khaia ngtün lü, a hnu lam tengki cun Pamhnama khaw am ä nghlawiki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyühkip la Nghngih a jah Tüihnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Acunkäna, Jesuh naw akce khyühkip la nghngih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyühkip la nghngih; avang üng khyükip tia ami yuk. </char></note> jah mcawn lü, a cehnak vaia mlüh la hmun avana, a maa, nghngih ci a jah tüih. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mt 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cang ah vai khawjah awmki, cunsepi atki ngcek ve; acunakyase, cang at khai a jah tüih law vaia, cangmah kthäh u lü ktaiyü ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mt 10:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Cit u; he hea ksunga to hea kba ka ning jah tüiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mt 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lk 9:3-5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ngui ip, kthäheinaka ngja, khawdawke ä nami jah cehei vai, lama khyang ä nami hnukset vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/><char style="wj">“Nami luhnak im avana, akma säiha, ‘Hina im üng dim'yenak pha law se’ nami ti vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/><char style="wj">“Acuna im üng dim'yenak ngjahlüki a awm üng nami pyena dim'yenak acunüng ani üng awm khai, ngjahlüki am a ve üng nami hnuksetnak nami lakin be vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acuna im üng awm laih laih u lü, ami ning jah pet nami eiawk vai; khüiki cun ngkheng khawiki ni. Im avan üng ä nami kai hü vai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/><char style="wj">“Nami luhnaka mlüh avan üng ami ning jah pet nami ei vai, </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/><char style="wj">“Ami mlüha am phetki he nami jah m’yai be vai, ami veia, ‘Pamhnama khaw naw ning jah k'et law ve’ nami ti vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ngs 13:51</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Mlüh nami luhnaka am ami ning jah cäinak üng, ami lam üng cit hü u lü,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/><char style="wj">‘Nami mlüh üngka mvut, kami khawpha üng kawpki pi nami khana kami khawki; cunsepi Pamhnama khaw naw ning jah k’et law ve’ nami ti vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Gen 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mt 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, ngthumkhyanaka mhmüp üng, Pamhnam naw acuna mlüha kthaka Sodom mlüh m'yenei bawk khai</char>.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Jumeikia Mlüh he</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mt 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Hesa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hez 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jol 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zakh 9:2-4</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Korazin mlüh aw, na jo se ve! Bethsaida mlüh aw, na jo se ve! Nangmi üng mdana kba müncankse he Turah la Sidon mlüha mdan vai sü ta, ajan denga jihkpyawn sui ni lü, mvut üng ngaw ni lü, ngjut päng khai sü xawi. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, ngthumkhyanaka mhmüp üng Pamhnam naw nanga kthaka ta Turah la Sidon mlüh jah m'yenei hlü bawk ve. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Hesa 14:13-15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nang Kapenawm mlüh, khankhaw däa mhlünmtaia kya lü pi, mulai mei däa ning khyaka na kya khai” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Upi, nami ngthu ngaiki cun, keia ngthu ngaikia kyaki; upi nami ngthu ä ngaiki cun keia ngthu ä ngaikia kyaki ni; upi keia ngthu ä ngaiki cun kei na tüi lawkia ngthu ä ngaikia kyaki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyühkip la Hghngih hea Nghlat law bea Mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Acunüng, khyühkip la nghngihe jekyainak am nghlat law be u lü, “Bawipa aw, na ngming am khawyai he kami jah ksäta kba awmki he,” ti u se,<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khawyam mkeka kba khankhaw üngka naw kya law se ka hmuh. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Sal 91:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ngai u, kphyukse he, jawngk’ai hea khana ngleheinak la, ye he jah nängnaka khyaihnak ka ning jah peki, i naw am ning jah lembawisak khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi khawyai he nami ti tia ami awma phäha ä jekyai ua; khankhawa nami ngming he angyuka phäha jekyai ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Jekyaiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mt 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Acunüng, Jesuh Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üng</char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang naw </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya üng, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang naw </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya naw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tia ami yuk.</char></note> jekyainak am be lü, <char style="wj">“Mce la khankhaw Bawipa, ka Pa aw! khyang ktheme la ngtheingthangki hea veia hina ngthu mjih lü, ä ngtheingthangki hea veia na ngdangsaka phäha ning jekyai na veng; ka Pa aw, acun cun na ngaiha dawki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:15">Jn 10:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ka Pa naw ahmäi na pe pängki. Capa u ni ti cun Pa dänga thea u naw am ksing; Pa u ni ti cun Capa la Capa naw a xüa khyang hea thea u naw am ksing thei u,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Acunüng, Jesuh axüisaw hea veia nghlat lü, anghmüa, <char style="wj">“Atuh hmuh vai he nami jah hmuki he nami jo sen ve; </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, sahma khawjah la, sangpuxang khawjah naw, nami jah hmuh la nami jah ngjak he, hmu hlü u lü ngja hlü kyawki he, am hmu u lü am ngja hlawt u,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samarih Khyang Kdaw am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mt 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, thumksing mat naw Jesuh a mhnüteinak am, “Saja aw, anglät xünnak ka yahnak vaia i ni ka pawh kawm?” ti se,<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cangcim üng i ng’yu se, ihawkba na ksingki ni?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Deut 6:5</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ani naw, “Bawipa na Pamhnam cun na mlungmthin avan, na xünnak avan, na kyannak avan la, na ngaikyunak avan am na jawngnak vai, acunüng na impeiloceng namäta kba na jawngnak vai’ tia awmki,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Msang thei veki, acunkba va pawha, na xüng khai ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Acunüng, acuna khyang naw ngnäng khaia bü lü, Jesuh üng, “Acunüng ka impeiloceng he ta u he ni?” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang mat Jerusalem üngka naw Jerikhoa ju cit khai sü, khyang m'yuk’eie jah sawngei msawk se, acun he naw a suisak jah suh pe u lü, thi khyo khaia kpaiki he naw ami ceh tak. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ktaiyü mat, acuna lam bä üng citki naw, a hmuh la lam kpema ngpeng lü a ceh tak. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/><char style="wj">“Acukba bäa, Levih khyang mat pi acuna hmun pha law lü, a hmuh la lam kpema ngpeng lü citeiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33,34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2Khro 28:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Cunsepi, Samarih khyang mat a kdungnak lama, acuna awmnak pha law hngaki naw, a hmuh la m'yenei leng leng lü, </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/><char style="wj">a veia va cit lü, a nghma üng situi la capyitui am jah bui lü, hlawpki naw, amäta sangnghngaksaü üng taih lü, khin ima cehpüiki naw, a msümcei. </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/><char style="wj">“A ngawi üng, denarih tangka nghngih, khin im ngängki üng pe hüt lü, ‘Ana msümceia, hina thea pi na bäihnak, avan pi ka nghlat law be üng ning thung be kawng’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acuna kthum he üng m'yuk’eie jah sawngeikia khyanga khana impei locenga kba biloki cun ua ni na ngaih?”</char> ti se,<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Thumksing naw, “M'yeneinak taki cen” a ti. Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nang pi acunkba va pawha,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Matah la Mariha Ima citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38,39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, Jesuh la axüisaw he ami ceh lama ngnam mat üng lut u se, acuia a ngming Matah naki naw a na khinak. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Acuna, nghnumia hnunpüi Marih naki nghnumica mat awmki. Acuna nghnumica cun Jesuha khaw kunga ngthu ngai lü ngawki. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Acunüng, Matah cun khüi lü am ngbüneiki, Jesuha veia law lü, “Bawipa aw, ka na naw ka mät däng ka khüi khaia ana yawkin hin na dawsaki aw? Na kpüi law khaia mtheha,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Matah, Matah, aktäa ngaikyu lü bawngbai veki; </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, aktung mat däng awmki. Marih naw akdaw xüei ve, acun cun u naw pi yuhei hlawt vaia am kya ve,” </char>ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Ktaiyünak a jah Mthei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mt 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Mhmüp mat üng Jesuh ktaiyü se, a ktaiyü khap üng axüisaw mat naw, “Bawipa aw, Johan naw ktaiyünak axüisaw he üng a jah mtheia kba jah mtheia,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami ktaiyü üng hinkba ti ua, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">‘Kami Pa,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Na ngming ngcim leisawngnak am ve se. </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Na khaw pha law se. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Amhmüp tä kami ei khyawh buh jah pe.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">kami ei khyawh buh </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">am acunüng </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">khawngawi kami ei vai buh. </char>
    </note><verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Jah katnaki kami mhlät khawia kba, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">nang naw pi kami katnak he jah mhläta. </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">Hlawhlepnaka am jah cehsak kaw pi,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi üng mat naw, mthan nglunga a püia veia cit lü, ‘Ka püi aw, muk kthum na kpu lawa; </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/><char style="wj">Ka khin law ve, mbei vai i am ta veng’ a ti üng; </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/><char style="wj">im k'um üngka naw, ‘Ä na kpyaneia; ksaw khai päng veng, ka ca he pi ihnak üng ip päng ve u; tho law lü am ning pe law hlü thei veng’ ti lü, a msang te, </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/><char style="wj">Ka ning jah mthehki, a püia akya aphäha, tho law lü am ava pete, ä khyakei lü a kthähei nua phäha tho law lü, a ngaih jah pe khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ka ning jah mthehki, kthäh ua, acunüng nami yah khai; sui ua, acunüng nami hmu khai; khawk ua, acunüng ksawh ning jah mhmawn pe khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/><char style="wj">“Upi, kthähki avan naw yah khawiki, upi suiki naw hmu khawiki, upi khawki am ksawh mhmawn pe khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi üngka pa, a ca naw muk kthäh se, u naw lung pe khai aw? Nga kthäh se, u naw ngaa nghnün üng kphyu pe khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng aiktui kthäh se, u naw jawngk’ai pe khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi khyang kse he naw pi nami ca üng akdaw pet vai nami ksing üng, nami Pa khankhawa ka naw, kthähki avan üng Ngmüimkhya Ngcim aktäa pe hlü ve,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh la Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mt 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw khawyai am ngthuhei theiki mat a ktäm. Acunüng khawyai a kco law la ä ngthuhei theikia khyang cun ngthuhei law be thei se khyang he aktäa cäicah lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note>Khyang avang he naw, “Khawyai mkhawng Beelzebula johit am ni khawyai he a jah ktäm,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref></char>
    </note>Avang naw ami mhnüteinaka, khan üngka ti ksingnak vai müncankse kthähki he. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ami ngaihkyunak jah ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Ia pung pi amimät ngcawhki he cun pyeh khawiki he ni; khuiim mat üngka he pi amimät ngcawhki he cun khyük khawiki he ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/><char style="wj">“Khawyama khaw pi amimät ami ngtuk üng ihawkba a khaw khäng khai ni? Beelzebula a peta johit am khawyai he jah ksätki nami tiki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/><char style="wj">“Acukba ka jah ksätkia akya üng, ihawkba nami hnukläk he naw khawyai jah ksätkie ni? Nami mäta hnukläk he naw nami hleinak mdan ve u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, kei naw Pamhnama johit am khawyai he jah ktäm khawikia ka kya üng, Pamhnama khaw nami veia pha law pängki. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khyang kyan naw likcim kpawmei lü a im a ngänga küt üng, a khawhthem mä lü awm khawiki; </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi amäta kyan bawki naw tu law lü, a näng law üng, a üpnaka likcim he jah yut lü, a khawhthem lo lü, jah yet hü khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, upi ka hlawnga am awmki cun, ka yea kyaki; upi am na mkhämpüiki cun kthehkia kyaki. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawyaia Nghlat law be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mt 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, khawyai khyanga k'um üngka naw a luh law üng, a xüieinak vai sui hü lü, tuia am a awmnak hnünea ngvak hü khawiki; acunüng, xüieinak vai am hmu lü, ‘Ka luh lawnaka ima nghlat be vang’ ti lü, </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/><char style="wj">ava pha be üng ana phekphaih u lü a na dawkya sak u se a hmuh. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/><char style="wj">“Acun la va cit be lü, amäta pi se bawki khawyai kce khyüh jah lawpüi se, acunüng lut u lü awmki he, acuna khyanga awm law vai cun akma a na awm khawia pi ksehlen bawki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hlimnak Kcang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Acukba ngthu ana pyen k'um üng, khyang hea ksunga nghnumi mat ngpyang law lü, a veia, “Ning pawi nakia pum la ning tukia cih ta a jo sen ve,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acuna kthaka ta, Pamhnama ngthu ngai lü acuna kba awmki he, ami jo sen bawk ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Müncankse ami Mso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mt 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char>
    </note> Acunüng, khyang he a veia ami ngbum law üng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Atuh ngsawn he hin se ve u; müncankse suiki he, cunsepi, Jonaha müncankse dänga thea msingnak ä jah pet vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Jn 3:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Jonah Ninevih khyang hea msingnaka a kyaa kba, khyanga Capa pi atuh khyang hea hama msingnaka kya khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Sang 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Khro 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Sheba sangpuxangnu, Solamona themnak ngaiei khaia athuknak üngka naw lawkia kyase, ngthumkhyanaka mhmüp üng, atuh ngsawn hea veia tho law ha lü jah mkat law khai. Ngai u Solamona kthaka kyäp bawki hia awm ve. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Jn 3:5</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ninevih khyang he, Jonaha ngthu pyena phäha ngjutki hea kyase, ngthumkhyanaka mhmüp üng, atuh ngsawn hea veia ngdüi law hnga u lü, jah mkat law khai he; ngai u, Jonaha kthaka kyäp bawki hia awm ve. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumsa Vainak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8:16</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“U naw meiim mdäi lü am thup khawi u, cäa k'uma</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:33 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">avang üng cäa k’uma </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ti am ami yuk si. </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">pi am thup khawi u, lutki he naw ami hmuh vaia angdangnak üng ni ami tak khawi. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/><char style="wj">“Pumsa meiim cun mika kyaki. Acunakyase na mik avai üng na pumsa avan vai bäihki. Cunsepi, na mik a pyeh üng na pumsa avan nghmüpki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, akvai nami k'uma awmki, am a nghmüp vaia cäi na u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng na pumsa ä nghmüp lü avan a vai üng, meiim naw aktäa a kcäiha kba, na pumsa vai bäih khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Pharise he la Thum Ksing he jah Mkateiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Jesuh ana ngthuhei k'um üng Pharise mat naw buh ei khaia khü se cit lü buh eiki. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Acunüng a kut am mthih lü buh ei se a hmuh üng, Pharise aktäa cäiki. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Acunüng Bawipa naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi Pharise he khawt la kbe akpung lama nami mthi khawiki; cunsepi nami mlungmthin k'uma setnak la katnak am nami beki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/><char style="wj">“Khyang k'ang he aw! Akpung pi pyang lü ak’um pi pyangki cun Pamhnam am niki aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nami khawt la nami kbe üng awmki m'yenkseki he üng jah pe ua. Acunüng, ahmäi nami hama ngcim hei law khai ni. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Nangmi Pharise he, nami jo se ve! Kcingyüt paibänge la khuhlip kce he pi xa üng mat pet vaia nami khüiki. Cunsepi, hmankanak la Pamhnam jawng'engnak am nami cäi naki. Ahin he va jah pawh ma u lü akce he pi nami jah pawh vai sü. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi Pharise he nami jo se ve, Sinakoka ngawhnak akdaw säih la jawihtuknaka nghnukset kyu nami jawng naki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/><char style="wj">“Nami jo se ve, ng’uhnün tia ä ngsing se, khyang he naw ä ksing u lü, a khana ami ceh hünak am nami tängki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Acunüng, thum ksingki mat naw, “Saja aw, hina ngthu na pyen hin keimi pi na jah ksenaki ni” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Thumksing he aw, nangmi pi nami jo se ve! Phüi kse khyanga khana nami mtaihki, namimät naw nami kutmdawng am pi am nami hnet hlüki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/><char style="wj">“Nami jo se ve! nami pupa he naw ami hnim, sahma hea mkhya im nami saki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nami pupa hea ami bilawh cun jah ksingpüi u lü, nami jah ngaisimpüiki ni; amimi naw hnim u se, nangmi naw ami mkhya ime nami jah saki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, Pamhnama ksingnak naw pi pyen lü, ‘Sahma he la ngsä he jah tüih pe ni se, avang jah mkhuimkha u lü, jah hnim khai he,’ </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/><char style="wj">acunakyase, khawmdeka ngtüi üng tün lü, ngsawikia sahma hea thisen, </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2Khro 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Abela thisen üngka naw tün lü, Temple la kphyawnkunga nglaka ami hnim Zakhariha thisen naw hina ngsawn hea phu jah kthäh be khai. Ä, akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, acun naw hina ngsawn hea phu jah kthäh be khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>
    <char style="wj">“Thumksing he, ksingnaka imksawh mhmawnak tawh nami thupkia kyase nami jo se ve. Namimät pi am lut u lü lut hlüki he pi nami jah mkhyawhki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Jesuh naw acuna hmün a cehtak üng thumksing he la Pharise he naw ami mkateinak vaia,<verse eid="LUK 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>a pyen law msawk ami man hlüa phäha, ngäng u lü ang'enga ahmäi hmäi ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Hypocrit he jah Cäieinak vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mt 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mt 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mk 8:15</ref></char>
    </note>Khyang kdäm he ngleh kyu u lü, ami ngbum law üng, Jesuh naw, axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Pharise hea nghen cäei na ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ä ngdang khaia thup avan ngdang lü, ä ngsing khaia mjih avan ngphyeh khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nghmüp üng nami pyen avan avainaka ngjaka kya khai; asithawta nami pyen avan im khana sang khai he. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">U Kyüh vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mt 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka püi he aw, ning jah mtheh veng, ‘Pumsa hnim lü, acun käna akce i am pawh theiki he ä jah kyüh ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, nami kyüh vai ta; Aning jah hnim päng üng, mulai mei üng ning jah tawn thei khai Mhnam kyüh ua. Ka ning jah mthehki ani cen kyüh ua. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khaca mhma peni tangka nghngiha am jawi khawiki he aw? Acuna khaca matca pi Pamhnam naw am mhnih khawi naw. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/><char style="wj">“Nami lusam pi täh bäiha kyaki. Khaca khawjaha pi nami küi bawki ni, am kyü ua. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Manak la Jumnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mt 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng ka ning jah mtheki, khyang hea maa na yungki cun, Pamhnama khankhawngsä hea maa, khyanga Capa naw yung hnga khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, khyang hea ma na maki cun, Pamhnama Capa naw Mhnama khankhawngsä hea hmaia ma khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mt 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mk 3:29</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, khyanga Capa pyetseki avan cun, ami pyetsenak mhläta kya khai; cunsepi, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim pyetseki cun, mhläta am kya. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11,12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mt 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Lk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Acunüng Sinakok he, bawi he la khaw uki hea veia ami ning jah cehpüi üng ‘ikba ka jah msang khai, i ka pyen khai,’ tia ä nami cäi vai, </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/><char style="wj">acuna kcün üng nami pyen vai cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw ning jah mthehei law khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang k'ang Bawimangki am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Acunüng, khyang hea ksunga mat naw Jesuh üng, “Saja aw, ka hnunpüi he naw khawh ami na ngpaipüi vaia jah mtheha,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nghngicim nangmia khana u naw ngthumkhya khai la khawh yet khaia ana mcawn ni?”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Acunüng ami veia, <char style="wj">“Cäiei u lü, mnaiheinak avan üng ngxungei kyu u; ihlawka bawimang u lü pi bawimangnak üng nami xünak am ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ami veia msuimcäpnak pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Bawimangki mat, a khaw daw se, eiawk da na leng lengki naw, </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/><char style="wj">ngaikyu lü, ‘Hawkba ni ka ti kawm? Eiawk taknak vai am ta veng’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, ‘Hikba pawh vang; ka khei he jah phye lü, angbaü bawka sa lü, acunüng eiawk he la, ka khawhthem he ka jah ta khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/><char style="wj">Acunüng ka ngmüimkhya üng, ‘Ka ngmüimkhya aw, khawkum khawvei khäk khai khawhthem na taki ni; xüiei lü, ei lü aw lü, hlimtui lü awma, ka ti khai,’ tia ngai kyuki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, Pamhnam naw, ‘Khyang k'ang aw, tuhngawi mthan na ngmüimkhya khyük khaia kyaki; acunakyase, na mcuneia khawhthem u naw ka na khai aw?’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Amäta hama khawhthem mcun lü, Pamhnam üng am bawimangki he cun, acuna mäih lawki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhnam Jumei ua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mt 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ka ning jah mtheki, ‘I ka ei khai?’ tia, nami xünnak vai ja, ‘I ka suisa khai?’ tia, nami pumsa phäha nami mlung ä bawngbai sak ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/><char style="wj">“Eia kthaka ta xünnak kyäp bawki ni, suisaka kthaka ta pumsa kyäp bawki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/><char style="wj">“Vangak he jah ngai u, cang am saw u, am at u, mcunnak am ta u, khei am ta u; cunsepi, Pamhnam naw jah mcahki, nangmi cun kha hea kthaka ta nami küi bawki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a xünak msaüei thei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am acunüng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khawvei xüng thuk. </char></note><char style="wj">“Nangmi üng u naw a mlung bawngkhasak lü a xünnak msaüei thei khai ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/><char style="wj">“Ahinca he pi am jah pawh thei u lü, ivaia akcea phäha nami mlung nami bawngkha saki ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Sang 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Khro 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Lili kheipai he cen jah teng ua; khut am pawh u, nghmüi pi am bi u; cunsepi ka ning jah mthehki, Solamon pi a hlüngtainak avan am ngcüngceiei se, hina lili kheipai matca pi am tängeipüi khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, atuh xüng se, angawia mei üng tawnena khuhlip pi Pamhnam naw a thuihawi sak üng, nangmi cun acuna kthaka pi am ning jah thüihawi sak bawk khai aw. Ihlawka nami jumnak ngceki ni! </char><verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nami ei vai la nami awk vai ä sui ua; ä cäicing ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/><char style="wj">“Am jumeiki he naw acuna ngkhaw avan cun sui khawiki he ni; acun nami hlüki ti nami Pa naw ksingki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/><char style="wj">“Akcüka Pamhnama khaw sui u, acun käna acun he avan ning jah pe khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khana Bawimangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mt 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka hnukläk toca he aw, ä kyü ua; nami Pa naw khaw aning jah pet vai ngjahlüki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/><char style="wj">“Nami ka avan jah jawitu u lü, m'yenkseki he üng jah pe ua; nami mäta suiawi la nami khawhthem ä sui u lü m’yuk’ei naw am a m’yuk thei kca naw pi am a kpyeh thei khankhaw bawimangnak sui ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, nami khawhthema awmka nami mlung awm theikia kyaki. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngcüngceikia M'ya he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mt 25:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Ahmäi apha law üngka vaia ngsuingsa u lü, a na ngcüngcei u lü, nami meiim mdäiei u; </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mk 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“M'ya he naw ami mahpa cambumnak pawi üngka naw law be lü ksaw a khawk law üng ksawh mhmawn ngxit khaia ami na k’äiha kba a na ve ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/><char style="wj">“Ami mahpa a law be üng, a na ngäng u se a jah hmuh lawa m'ya he cun ihlawka jekyai khai he ni; akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, a mahpa cun a khyü vawpei lü, buh ei khai hea jah ngawhsak lü, amät naw jah ngäng law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/><char style="wj">“Mthan lunga pi kyase, acun käna pi kyase, ami mahpa naw law lü, acunkba a jah hmuh lawa m'ya he ta, ami jo sen ve. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:39,40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mt 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Cunsepi, hin hin ksing ua, m'yük'eia law vai imah naw a ksing vai sü ta, a im am a phyet vaia ngäng khai sü. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, nangmi pi ana ngtünei u lü awm u, am nami simeia kcün üng khyanga Capa law khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Dawki la Dawkia M'ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mt 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Acunüng Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, hina msuimcäpnak hin, keimi däng üng aw na jah mtheh? Akce hea hama pi kyaki aw? ti se,<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Bawipa naw, <char style="wj">“Khawhthem mceiki, üpnak cang, ngsüm kcangki, a mahpa naw akha law üng ami ei vai pawh khaia, mkhawnga a mcawn vai ta, u ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/><char style="wj">“A mahpa naw, a law be üng, acunkba ana pawh se a hmuh lawa m'ya ta ihlawka jekyai khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, ani üng a tak avana khana mkhawnga mcawn law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, acuna m'ya naw a mlung k'uma, ‘Ka mahpa am law be ng’xit khai’ ti lü, m'yanu, m'yapa he jah na kpai lü, a na ei aw ktat lü, a na awm k'um üng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amcäm cäma khyüng; am acunüng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kpunga tawnin. </char></note><char style="wj">am a na sümei, am a na ksingeia mhmüp üng a mahpa law be lü, acuna m'ya cun amcäm cäma khyüng lü pyen ä ngjakia hlawnga atänga jah ta hmaih khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/><char style="wj">“M'ya, a mahpa a ngaih ksing mah mah lü, a mahpaa ngaiha pi am a na pawhmsahki cun, khawveia kpai khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, a mahpaa ngaih am bilo lü kpaihnak vaia iyaw bilo msawkia m'ya cun ajaw dänga kpai khai he. Upi, akdäm ami peta veia akdäm kthäh be khai he; Upi, akdäm bawk ami peta veia akdäm bawk kthäh be khai he. </char><verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Phäha Ngpainak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mt 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khawmdek khana mei däi sak khaia ka lawki, atuh pi acutei vai ngja hlü veng! </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mk 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, baptican mat ka khan vai awm ve, acuna baptican am ka khan hlan üng ka mlung aktäa khuikha ve! </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek khana ng'yäpnak lawpüi khaia ka lawkia nami ngaiki aw? Acukba vaia am law nawng. Ngpainak lawpüi khaia ni ka law ve.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/><char style="wj">“Atuh käna, im mat üng mhma ngpai khai he, kthum naw nghngih hneng law khai, nghngih naw kthum hneng law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Pae naw capa he jah hneng law u se, capa he naw pa he jah hneng law khai he; ami nu he naw ami canu he jah hneng law u se, ami canu he naw ami nu he jah hneng law khai he; ami ni he naw ami pai he jah hneng law u se, ami pai he naw ami ni he jah hneng law khai he,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akcün Ksingnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mt 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, khyang hea veia, <char style="wj">“Khawnghngi kyak lama khawngmei ngjing se nami hmuh üng, ‘khaw a hlü ve’ ti u lü, nami tia kba kya law khawiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, cum khawkhi nami ksing üng, ‘khaw ngling hlü ve’ ti u lü, nami tia kba kya law khawiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi Hypocrit he naw, khawmdek la khankhawa ngtünawngnak pi nami ksingki naw, ise atuha kcün hin am nami ksing theiki ni? </char><verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Na Ye na Ng’yäpüi vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mt 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ise angtäia pawh vaia cun namimät naw pi am nami mtaiei theiki ni?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ning hnengki am ngthumkhyakia veia nani ceh hmai üng, nani ceh lama nani ng’yäpnak vai na sui vai; am acunüng ta ngthumkhyakia veia ning cehpüi se, ngthumkhyaki naw khyang manki am ning man sak se, khyang manki naw thawngim üng ning khyüm khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/><char style="wj">“Ka pyenki, pet vaia ngui am na peta küt üng thawngim üngka naw am na lät khai ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nami Katnak Ngjut u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Acunüng, Kalile khaw khyang he ngkengnak ami pawh k'um üng Pilat naw a jah hnima mawng Jesuh üng ami mtheh. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acuna Kalile khyang he, acunkba ami khuikha phäha, akce Kalile khyang hea kthaka mkhyekat bawki hea nami ngaiki aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, acunkba am kya; nangmi pi am nami ngjut üng acunkba nami thi hnga khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/><char style="wj">“Am acunüng khyang xaleikhyet Silawng im ksaü naw jah kyuk si se thiki he cen, Jerusalema awmki hea kthaka mkhyekat pawki hea nami ngaiki aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, acunkba am kya; nangmi pi am nami ngjut üng acunkba nami thi hnga khai” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Mtheihkia Fik Thing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw msuimcäpnak pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang mat naw capyit a ngvawng k'uma a ngling mat awmki, law lü a ktheih a sui law üng a ngtheih mat hman pi am a hmuh. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ngvawng kbi üng, Tenga, law lü a ktheih ka sui lawnak khawkum kthum law pängki, a ktheih matca pi am hmu veng. Khyua! ivai amdanga khawmdek kyawh lü awmki ni?”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ngvawng kbi naw, ‘Ka mahpa aw, tuhmü kum ahikba awm tang se, a phung co lü, sea ek am mcah kawng; </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/><char style="wj">‘Seng kum a ngthei üng aktäa daw lü, am a ngtei üng khyu kaw pi”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Nghnumi Akxo mat Sabbath Mhmüp üng M’yai beki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw Sinakoka k’uma Sabbath mhmüp üng a jah mthei. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Acunüng kum xaleikhyet ngmüimkhya kse naw awm na se khuikha lü ngkunki, amät angdünga am ngdüiei thei süm sümki nghnumi mat awmki. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw a hmuh la khü lü, <char style="wj">“Nghnumi aw, am na yainak üngka naw lät veki” </char>ti lü, <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>a khana a kut taih se, acun la angxita ngdüng law lü, Pamhnam mküimtoki.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9">Ex 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Deut 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Jesuh naw Sabbath mhmüp üng khyang a mdaw bea phäha Sinakok ngvai a mlung so lawki naw, khyang he jah mtheh lü, “nghngicim khüihnak vai mhmüp khyuk awmki, acunüng law u lü ngmangei law kyusak ua, Sabbath mhmüp üng ä law ua” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Acunüng, Bawipa naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Nangmi Hypocrit he, Sabbath mhmüp üng nami se, nami sanghngaksaü sut u lü, tui aw khaia am nami cehpüi khawikia kya aih se? </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/><char style="wj">“Hina nghnumi hin Abrahama canua kyaki, teng u, khawyam naw kum xaleikhyet a manei Sabbath mhmüp üng ä lät sak vai aw?” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Acunüng, acunkba pyen se hnengkie ami van ami hmai seki; acunüng, khyang he ami van Jesuh naw hlüngtai kyäpsawknak a pawha phäha jekyaiki he.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anca Ui am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mt 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnama khaw cun i mäih ni a law? I am ni ka msümcäp kawm? </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Anca ui mat, khyang naw lo lü a ngvawng k'uma a phu am tängki ni; acun cun cawt law lü, thinga kya law se, kha he naw angban üng ami ngbu ami pawhnak am tängki ni” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nghngen am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mt 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnama khaw cun i am ni ka msuimcäp kawm?” </char>ti be lü, <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnama khaw cun, nghnumi naw nghngen lo lü, khai tawng kthum üng thun se, khai avan thawh sakia nghngnen am tängki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkawt Ngcek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mt 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21-23">21—23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Acunüng, Jesuh cun mlüh he la ngnam he üng jah hei mthei vü lü, Jerusalem khawa citki. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Acunüng, khyang mat naw Jesuh üng, “Saja aw, akjaw däng japaw küikyana ami kya kawm?” ti se, Jesuh naw, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/><char style="wj">“Mkawt ngcek üng nami luh vaia ktha na ua; ka ning jah mthehki, khyang khawjah lut khaia ngtün u sepi, am lut thei khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/><char style="wj">“Imah tho law lü, ksaw a khai käna nangmi kpunga ngdüiki he naw, ‘Bawipa aw, ksawh jah mhmawna’ tia ksawh nami khawk law üng, ani naw, ‘nangmi hawia ka he, am ning jah ksing khawi nawng? ti lü ning jah msang khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/><char style="wj">Acunüng nangmi naw, ‘Mi ei aw hmaih khawiki, kami khawloa pi na jah mthei hü khawiki ni’ nami ti law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Sal 6:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Acunüng ani naw, ‘Ka ning jah mthehki, nangmi hawia ka he am ning jah ksing khawi nawng, nangmi khyang kse he, ka vei üngka naw cit ua’ ti law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mt 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Abraham, Isak, Jakop la sahma he avan Pamhnama khaw k’uma awm u se jah hmu u lü, nangmi ngpunga ning jah ktäm ti, nami ksing law üng, acunüng, nami mnicui ha kyet u lü nami kyap khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mt 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, nghngilaw lam la nghngikyak lam, acum la asip üngka naw khyang he law u lü, Pamhnama khaw buhpawhnaka ngaw law khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mt 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, atuh hnuki he ma law u lü, atuh maki he hnu law khai he” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Jerusalem a Jawngnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mt 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Acunüng Pharise he avang a veia law u lü, “Herod naw aning hnim vai ngaih ve, hina hmün üngka naw ktawih lü akcea cita” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">Acuna saui üng hina ngthu va mtheh ua, ‘Tuhngawi la khawngawi, khawyai he ka jah ktäm khai, am phetki he pi jah mdaw be lü, amhmüp thum üng ka khut ka kpäng khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi tuhngawi, khawngawi la a ngawi üng pi ka cit laih laih khaia kyaki. Jerusalema thea ta pung kcea sahma hnim vaia am kya naw,</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem! sahma he jah hnimki, na veia Pamhnam naw a jah tüih law lung am jah vawiki, ainu naw a ca he a ngphya k’uma a jah awpa kba, na khyang, ivei ni ka jah awp hlü te nang naw am na ngjak hlü veki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sal 118:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nami Temple yawka kya khai. Ka ning jah mthehki, ‘Bawipa ngming üng lawki hin Pamhnam naw dawnak pe se’ am nami tia küt üng am nami na hmu be ti khai” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw am Phetki Khyang mat a M’yai be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Sabbath mhmüp üng Pharise mata ima buh ei khaia cit se, ami mcih. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Acunüng, a ma a kutkhaw ngphyüngki Jesuha veia law se, <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Jesuh naw thumksing he la Pharise he jah kthäh lü, <char style="wj">“Sabbath mhmüp üng m’yai be vai ngkawiki aw?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Acunüng am ngthuhei u lü awm u se, Jesuh naw, am phetki cun khü lü, m’yai beki naw, a tüih be. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mt 12:11</ref></char></note>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi üng u naw, a ca pi kyase, a sea pi kyase, sabbath mhmüp üng khui uk'uma kya se angxita am lo be khai aw?” </char>ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Acunüng, acuna ngthu cun am msang thei u lü awmki he.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mlung Hnemnak la Dawnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Acunüng, khin he naw ngawhnak akdaw ami xüei khawi jah hmu lü, msuimcäpnak jah mthehki naw, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Ngthk 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khyang naw cambumnaka aning khüei üng, akyäpnak säiha ä na ngawh vai, nanga kthaka kyäp bawki khina se, </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ning khüeiki naw, na veia law lü, ‘Hina khyang am ngawhnak mkena’ ti se, acunüng, ngkekhyakeinak am ahnemnak säiha na ngpyawt khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/><char style="wj">“Ami ning khuei üng am adawnak säiha na ngawh vai, acunüng, ning khüeiki naw na veia law lü, ‘Ka püi aw, akyäpnak bawka va ngawa’ ning ti na se, acunüng, na buheipüi hea hmuha mhlünmtaia na kya khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lk 18:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Aktäa hlüng khaia ngai kyuki avan hnem lü, hnem khaia ngai kyuki avan mhlünmtaia kya khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw amät Khüeiki üng pi, <char style="wj">“Nang naw mhmüp eia pi kyase, müeia pi kyase pawh lü, khyang na khüei üng, na püi he, na bena he, na paca he, bawimangkia na impei locenge ä na jah khuei vai; amimi naw pi ning khüei be u se, ngkhengnak na yah msawk khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, buh na pawh üng, m'yenkseki he, am kümkawiki he, akxoe, amikmüe na jah khüei vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/><char style="wj">“Acukba na jah khüei üng na jo sen khai. Isetiakyaküng, acun he naw ä ning thung be theiki hea kyase, khyang kdawe ami thawh law bea mhmüp üng Pamhnam naw ning pe be khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Buh Pawhnak am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mt 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Acunüng, a buh eipüi mat naw acuna ngthu cun ngja lü, a veia, “Pamhnama khawa buh ei khai he ta ami jo sen ve,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw mtheh lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang mat naw, müei akyäpa pawh lü, khyang khawjah a jah khüei. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/><char style="wj">“Buh ei kcün üng a jah khüeia khyang he cun, ‘law u, ahmäi ngpäng ve’ ti lü a m'ya a tüih. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ami van naw atänga lätnak sui u lü, akma säih naw a veia, ‘Khaw kheih ni se, teng khaia cit hlü veng na bä ni na mhläta’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, akce mat naw, ‘Se sui xa kheih ni se, adaw aset ka teng khaia cit hlü veng na bä ni na mhläta’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng akce be tü naw, ‘Khyumah ni se am law hlü thei veng’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng m'ya naw, a mahpaa veia acuna ngthu cun va mtheh se, a mlung thüi lü a m'ya üng, ‘angxita ktawiha, mlüh ksung, lam avana cit lü, pyenksekie, am kümkawiki he, akxoe la, amikmüe la a khaw kse he jah lawpüia,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng a m'ya naw, ‘Saja aw, na na mtheha kba ka pawh päng teki khuiim ngsawng lü, kpawihei laih laih ve’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a bawipa naw, a m'ya üng, ‘angxita ktawiha, khaw kpung, lamnu, lamkse avana cit lü, ka ima benak vaia, jah va ling na. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning mthehki, ka jah khüeia khyang he mat naw pi ka buh pawh am ei khai he a ti’ ti lü,” </char>a jah mtheh.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Hnukläka Kyanak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mt 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Acunüng, khyang khawjah naw a veia läk u se, ami veia nghlat lü, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mt 10:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Upi, ka veia lawki naw a nu la a paa pi kyase, a khyuca hea pi kyase, a hnunpüi kphyaibee la, amäta pi kyase a jawngnaka kthaka kei am ana jawngnak üng, ka xüisawa am kya thei khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Upi, amäta kutlamktung kawt lü am na läk lawki cun ka xüisawa am kya thei khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi üngka mat naw, imnu sa khaia ngtünki naw, a saknak vai ngui ‘khäk khai aw, am khäk khai aw’ ti akcüka ngaw lü am ngaikyu khai aw. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/><char style="wj">“Acukba am akya üngta ktungthing jah nglin päng lü am na kpäng hmuki he naw ning yaihei khai he ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/><char style="wj">‘Hina khyang naw, imnu ngtün na lü am mkhüt ve’ tia ni kse na khai he.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, sangpuxang u naw sangpuhxang akce tu khaia a bü üng akcüka ngaw lü, khyang tawng nghngih am amät tu khaia lawki cun, khyang tawng at am mkhüt vai la am mkhüt vai ä ngai kyu khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/><char style="wj">“Am acunüng, sangpuxang kce am a pha law hlan üng, ng’yäpnaka ngthu kthäh khaia ngsä tüi khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/><char style="wj">“Acukba bäa, nangmi üngka upi, a tak naküt am ceh taki cun ka xüisawa am kya thei. </char><verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Summangei phya bekia Mci</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mt 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>
    <char style="wj">Mci hin dawki ni, cunsepi a paih käna i am mtui be thei vai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/><char style="wj">“Mdeka hama am daw ngsawnglinaka hama pi am daw, amdanga tawn khawiki he. Upi a ngjaknak vaia a nghnga awmki naw ngja se” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Khyükia To</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mt 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Lk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref></char>
    </note>Mhmüp mat üng ngcawnklawk he la khyangka he ngthu ngai khai hea Jesuha veia lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Acunüng, Pharise he la thum ksing he naw, “Hin naw khyangka he jah ngkhawtpüi lü, ami veia buh ei hnga ve” tia, ami mkatei. <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ami veia hina msuimcäpnak a pyen,<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi üngka mat to a phya taki naw, mat a khyüh üng, msaihmua kawkip la kaw jah yawk hüt lü, khyüki am a hmuh bea küt üng am sui lü ve khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a hmuh be üng jekyainak am a kphyengmcunga khana taihki naw, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/><char style="wj">ima a pha be la a püi he la, a impei locenge jah khü lü, ami veia, ‘Ka to khyüki hmu be veng na jekyai lawpüi ua’ am ti khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, acunkba bäa, ami ngjut vai am hlükia khyang ngsungpyun kawkip la kawa kthaka khyangka mat ngjutkia khana khankhawa jekyainak ve bawk khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyükia Nguikcang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng nghnumi mat naw nguikcang xa a tak, mat a mkhyüh üng, mei mdäiki naw, im phek lü, im avan üng am a hmuh bea küt üng am sui be lü ve khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a hmuh be üng a püi he la a impei locenge jah khü lü, ‘Ka nguikcang khyüki hmu be veng, na jekyai lawpüi ua’ am ti khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, acunkba bäa, khyangka mat, a katnaka phäha ngjutkia khana Pamhnama khankhawngsä he jekyai bawk khai he ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyükia Capa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Jesuh naw jah mtheh be lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang mat naw cangpyang nghngih a canak, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/><char style="wj">Anghmaw bawk naw a pa üng, ‘Ka pa aw, khawh ka bi vai na pea’ a ti. Acunüng ani pa naw khawh a jah kpai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, sängsäng se anghmaw bawk cun, a khawh he jah jawi lü, a thuknaka khawa citki naw, acuia hlimtuinak üng ngui a va kpäkcaih bäih. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a khawhthem a kpäkcaih bäih käna, acuna khaw üng aktäa khawjaw law se, a ei vai aktäa ng’yeng lawki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, acuna khaw üngka, khyang mat va ngdawn si se, acun naw vawk mcah khaia a loa a tüih.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, vawk ei pi ei hlü leng leng khaia, a ei aktäa ngaihki. U naw i pi am pe u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a ngsingei law kyu la, ‘Ka pa ima nghlawhkie naw pi am ami ei bäih vaia buh awmei khai se, kei hia ei cawi lü, thi law hlü veng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/><char style="wj">“Tho lü, ka pa veia ka cit khai, a veia, ka pa aw, khankhawa Pamhnam la, nanga khana katnak pawh veng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/><char style="wj">na capa vaia am ngkawi ti veng, na veia nghlawhki mata kba na ngaia, ka ti khai,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, tho law lü a pa veia citki. Acunüng athuknaka lama awm se, a pa naw a hmuh üng, aktäa m'yenei leng lengki naw, dawng si lü a nghngü üng kawi lü, aktäa a mhnam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a capa naw, ‘Ka pa aw, khankhawa Pamhnam la na khana katnak pawh veng, na capa vaia am ka ngkawiki ni’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, a pa naw a m'ya he üng, ‘Jihnu akdaw säih lawpüi ngxit u lü, ngvuihsak ua, a kut üng kutcüp nak sak u lü, a khaw pha üng khawdawke jah ngcumsak ua, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/><char style="wj">“Semce akthaü kcang lawpüi u lü hnim u, hlimtuikia mi ei aw vai u, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/><char style="wj">“Hina ka capa thiki xüng law beki, khyüki hmuh be ni’ a ti. Acunüng eiaw lawki he. </char><verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, a capa angvai bawk cun loa awmki, ima a pha law hlü be üng ami kcingbe la ami nglam ngja lü, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/><char style="wj">“M'ya mat khüki naw, ‘Ia ngkhaw he ni?’ ti lü a kthäh. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, m'ya naw, ‘Na na, law be se phyawng yaikia a hmuh bea phäha, na pa naw semce akthaü kcang hnimki ni’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, angvai ngai cun a mlung thüi lü im k’uma am lut hlü se a pa naw lut law lü a nghuinak. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, ani naw, a pa üng, ‘Ngaia, kum hi vei tamna kba ning khüih lü, na ngthu am ka ngaihnak am ve, ka püi he am hlimtuinak ka pawheinak vaia, meca, mat hman pi am na na pe khawiki, </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/><char style="wj">cunsepi, hina na capa, nghnumi kse hea veia, na khawhthem mdi hü bäihki, law be se, a hama semce akthaü na hnim peki’ ti lü a msang. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a pa naw, ‘Ka capa aw, ka veia khawvei na awmki ni, ka tak avan cun na ka ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/><char style="wj">“Na na, thiki xüng law beki, khyüki hmuh be ni, acunakyase, hlimtuinak la jekyainak am mi ve hlü ye se’ a ti,” </char>ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Khawh Mceikia Khyangkse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jesuh naw axüisaw hea veia hina ngthu a pyen be tü, <char style="wj">“Khyang bawimangki mat naw, a khawh mceiki mat a tak. Acuna khawh mceiki naw a mahpaa khawh kpäkcaihsak ve tia mawng a mahpa üng mtheh law u se, </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/><char style="wj">acunüng, a mahpa naw, ‘a khawh mceikia m'ya cun khü lü, na mawng ka ngjak hin ia suilam ni? Khawhtheme khana na bilawh na mtheh lawa. Atuh üng tün lü khawh mceikia am na kya ti khai’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, khawh mceiki naw a mlung k’uma ngai kyu lü, ‘Ka mahpa naw, a khawh ka mceinak üngka naw na pyaisak ve, lai co lü pi am ka nghlawh theiki, ka kthähei hü vaia pi ka ngkekhyakeiki, ikba ka awm khai ni?’ </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/><char style="wj">“Khawh mceinak üngka naw ami na pyaisak käna, ami ima na awmpüi khai hea püi ka tak üng daw khai ti ka ksingki,’ ti lü, </char><verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">acunüng a mahpaa khawh leinakia khyang he jah khü lü, akcüka veia, ‘Ka mahpaa khawh i kän na lei naki ni?’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/><char style="wj">“Acun naw, ‘Situi pung a phya lei na veng’ ti se, khawh mceiki naw, ‘angxita cajin lawpüi, ngaw lü, mhmakipa yua,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, akce mata veia, ‘Nang mä i kän na lei naki ni?’ a ti, ani naw, ‘cang tawng thawng at lei na veng’ ti se, khawh mceiki naw, ‘angxita na cajin lawpüi, ngaw lü, phya khyeta yua,’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, am dawkia khawh mceiki naw acunkba a jah pawhmsah law a mahpa naw hmu lü, aktäa, a ngak. Khawmdek khyang he amimäta hama ami bilawhnak üng, akvai üng awmki hea kthaka khyaih bawki he ni</char>,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Acunüng Jesuh bä naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, nami hama khawmdek khawhthem püi na ua, acunüng ni acun a bäih law üng anglät xünak ima ning jah do khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/><char style="wj">“Upi ajawcaa khana üpangak vaia awmki cun khawjaha khana pi üpangnak vaia ve khaia kyaki. Upi ajawca khana am üpangnak vaia awmki cun khawjaha khana pi üpangnak vaia am kya. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, khyük theikia khawmdek khawhthema khana pi am üpangnak vaia nami ve üng, u naw khawhthem kcang ning jah khämsak khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/><char style="wj">“Khyang kcea khawhthema khana pi üpangnak vaia am nami awm üng, u naw nami ka vaia ning jah pe khai aw? </char><verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mt 6:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">M'ya u naw mahpa nghngih am khüih khawi naw, mat ä ngja hlü lü, mat jawng na khai, am acunüng mat kü na lü mat kse na khai. Pamhnam la ngui atänga am nami jah khüih thei khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha Ngthu Pyen avang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mt 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Acunüng, ngui jawngnaki hea Pharise he naw acuna ngthu ngja u lü, ami yaihei.<verse eid="LUK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyanga hmuha nami cingcaihkia nami ngseki, cunsepi Pamhnam naw nami mlung ning jah ksingki ni; khyanga hmuha ami mküih cun Pamhnama hmuha msetei phyaki ni.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mt 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Mosia thum la sahma hea yuke cun Johana am a pha law hlan üng awmki, Johan üngka naw tün lü Pamhnama khaw thangkdaw cun sanga kyaki. Acunüng, khyang avan amthuia lut khawiki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mt 5:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Cunsepi, thum anglungcaa khyüh theia kthaka ta, khawmdek la khankhawa khyüh vai jäi bawk khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mt 5:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Upi a khyu mtai lü, nghnumi akce khyu naki cun a khyu mkhyekatki ni. Ami mtaia nghnumi khyu naki pi a khyu mkhyekat naki ni.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawimangpa la Lazaruh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Aktäa bawimangkia mangpa, aküi säiha thüi awi lü, amhmüp tä se hlimtui leng leng khaia ei aw lü awmki mat awmki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, khuikha leng lengkia khyang, Lazaruh ngming naki pi mat, a pumsa üng mnehkse am be se, mangpaa mkawt peia ami lawpüi, </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/><char style="wj">mangpa buhkbe peia kbuhkbaw ei khaia, a mkawt peia ngjän se ui he naw a mneh ami mleh law pet khawi. </char><verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, hinkba kyaki, Lazaruh thi se khankhawngsä he naw Abrahama peia ngaw khaia ami cehpüi. Acunüng, mangpa pi thi se k’uta kyaki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, khyang kthikhawa aktäa khuikha lü hang mdeiki naw athuknaka Abraham, a peia Lazaruh ngaw se hmu lü, </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/><char style="wj">‘Aw ka pa Abraham, na m'yeneia. Lazaruh naw a kutmdawngca tui üng hnet lü, ka mlei a ye law sak vaia ka awmnaka tui lawa, hina meikdäi üng khuikha leng leng veng’ ti lü ngpyangki. </char><verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng Abraham naw, ‘Ka capa aw, na xün k’um üng akdaw yah lü, acunkba Lazaruh naw am dawki a yah cen süma; cunsepi, atuh ani dim’yenak am ve se, nang khuikha veki, </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/><char style="wj">acuna thea, hin üngka naw nami veia cit hlüki he am ami cehnak thei vai la upi nangmia awmnak üngka naw keimi veia am ami lawnak thei vaia, mi nglaka nghawinu awmki’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng mangpa naw, ‘Am acunüng, ka pa aw, ka pa ima Lazaruh na tüih vaia hleng ning nghui na veng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/><char style="wj">ka hnunpüi kpami mhma awmki, hina khuikhanaka ä law msawk khai hea a jah va mtheh vaia’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng Abraham naw, ‘Mosi la sahma he awmki he, acun hea jah mtheh ngai khai he ni,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, mangpa naw, ‘Ka pa Abraham aw, acunkba am kya, khyang kthi he üngka mat, tho law be lü ngthu a pyen üng ta ami katnak nghlat ta khai he ni,’ a ti.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng Abraham naw, ‘Mosi la sahma hea ngthu am ami ngaih üng, khyang kthi üngka tho law be se pi am kcang na u,’ a ti”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Katnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mt 18:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Jesuh naw axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Katnak üng khyang kyukngtäng sak khaia biloki cun a jo se ve, </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/><char style="wj">“Hina anghmawca he üngka mat a mkhyekat saka kthaka ta a nghngü üng ksum khawp lü mliktui üng tawnin a hama daw bawk khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mt 18:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Cäei ua, na bena naw a ning katnak üng na mcäi vai, a ngjut üng na mhlät vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/><char style="wj">“Mhmüp mat üng khyüh vei ning mkhyekat na lü, khyüh vei, ‘ngjut veng’ ti lü, a ning law si üng na mhlät vai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Acunüng ngsä he naw, “Kami jumnak jah pung pea” ti u se,<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Anca ui nglung ata kba jumnak nami tak üng, hina thing üng, ‘Na pya maha ngphawng law lü, mliktuia khana va ngdüia’ ti u lü, nami ngthu ngai khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">M'ya mata Khutbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Cunsepi, nangmi üngka u naw a m'ya lai thawnkia pi kyase, toksäma pi kyase a law be üng, ‘law lü, ei law ktäia’ ti khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/><char style="wj">“Acukba am pyen lü, ‘ka ei vai na pyan law pea, na suisak suiawi lü, ka eiawk k’um üng na ngänga. Acunkäna namät ei kaw pi’ am ti khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/><char style="wj">“M'ya naw a mahpa a pyena kba a bilawha phäha a mahpa naw, ‘Na bä ni’ ti khai aw? Am ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/><char style="wj">“Acukba ngthupet he avan nami jah pawh käna, ‘Keimi hin kami mahpa kami jekyai sakia am kya naw, kami pawh kung vai kami pawhki ni,’ ti ua” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Khyang xa jah M’yai beki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Acunüng hinkba kyaki, Jerusalema ami ceh üng, Samarih la Kalile ng’yü jun üng citki. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Acunüng, ngnam mata a luh la, mnehkse mnehkia khyang xa naw ami na khyüm, acun he cun athuknaka ngdüi u lü, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>“Bawipa Jesuh aw, jah m'yeneia” tia, angsanga ngpyangki he.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunüng Jesuh naw, a jah hmuh üng, <char style="wj">“Cit u lü, ktaiyü hea veia va ngtengei kyusak ua”</char> a ti. Acunüng, hinkba kyaki, ami ceh k’um üng ami van ngcim lawki he. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Acunüng, ami van üngka mat naw, yai beki ti a ksing la, angsanga Pamhnam a mküimto maha, nghlat be lü, <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Jesuha khaw kunga kawp lü, jekyainaka ngthu a pyen; acuna khyang cun Samarih khyanga kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyang xa nami ngcim bekia am kya aih se? Kawe cen hawia ni ami ve? </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/><char style="wj">“Hina khyangmjükce naw Pamhnam mküimto khaia nghlat law beki hin” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tho law lü, cita; na jumnak naw ning yai sak be ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhnama Khawa pha law vaia Mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mt 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Acunüng, Pharise he naw, “Itia ni Pamhnama khaw a pha law kawm?” tia kthäh u se, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnama khaw cun hmuh thei vaia pha law khaia am kya; </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/><char style="wj">“Teng u, hia ni, cuia ni,’ ti vaia am kya, Pamhnama khaw cun nami k’uma awmki ni,”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nami k’uma ni, am acunüng nami ksunga ni, am acunüng nami veia ngdang lawki. </char></note> ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Acunüng, axüisaw hea veia, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa khawmhmüp he, mhmüp matca hleng hmu hlü u lü pi am nami hmuhnak thei vaia kcün pha law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, nami veia, ‘Teng u, hia ni, cuia ni’ ning jah tina khai he, ä cit u lü, ä nami jah läk vai; </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/><char style="wj">khaw nghmüm law se ‘khana mkek, khan avan üng a vai lawa kba, khyanga Capa a law bea mhmüp üng acunkba kya law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, am acun ham üng, aktäa khuikhanak khamei lü atuh ngsawn hea ksekhanak vaia awm khai</char>. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Gen 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Nawea kcün üngka kba khyanga Capa a law be üng pi kya law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Gen 7:6-24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nawe mlawng üng lut se, mlikpitui phu lawki naw ami van a jah mthihnaka mhmüp am a pha law hlana küt üng, ei aw u lü, ngkhyungla u lü awmki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Gen 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunakba Lotaha xün hün üng; ei aw u lü, khei u lü, jawitu u lü, nglingsaw u lü, ngsawngsaki he; </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/><char style="wj">cunsepi, Sodom khaw üngka naw, Lotah a ktawiha mhmüp üng khana üngka mei la kat, khawa a lawki naw ami van a jah mthiha kba, </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/><char style="wj">khyanga Capa a law bea mhmüp üng kya law khai.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mt 24:17</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mk 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Acuna mhmüp üng upi, mkyung khana awmki naw, im k’um üngka a khawhthem loei khaia ä kyum law se. Acuna kba laia awmki pi a hnua ä nghlat be se. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Gen 19:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Lotah khyu süm ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Upi, amäta xünnak küikyan khaia büki naw mkhyüh lü, upi a xünnak mkhyühki naw küikyanei khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, acuna mthan üng ihnak mat üng ipki xawia khyang nghngih, mat jäk se mat awm hüt khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 17:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ksum suki xawia nghnumi nghngih üngka mat jäk se mat awm hüt khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/><char style="wj">“Laia awmki xawi nghngih üngka, mat jäk se mat awm hüt khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he naw, “Bawipa aw, hawia ni?” tia ami kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akthia awmnak naküta nghmukse he ngcun khai he,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Hmeinu la Ngthumkhyaki am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Acunüng, am pyai u lü, ktaiyü vai, ti ami ksingnak vaia, ami veia, msuimcäpnak am ngthu jah mtheh lü; <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/><char style="wj">“Mlüh mata, Pamhnam am kyüh lü, khyang ia am msuikia ngthumkhyaki mat awmki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, acuna mlüh üng hmeinu mat awmki, acun naw, ‘Ka ngcuhpüia veia ngtäi khaia ngthu na mkhya law pea’ ti lü, a law si laih laih. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng ngthumkhyaki naw khawvei am a ktä te, akäna a mlung k'uma ngaikyu lü, ‘Pamhnam am kyüh lü, khyang ia am msui ni se pi, </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/><char style="wj">hina hmeinu naw na mkhuimkha hlü ve, ngthu va mkhya pe vang, am acunüng ta law laih laih lü na mkhuimkha lü, na bawngkha hlüsak ve,’ a ti,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Am ngtäikia ngthumkhyaki naw a pyen cen ngai süm ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/><char style="wj">“A jah jawng'engnaka khyang he naw, amhmüp amthan ngpyang u lü, ami kthäh üng, Pamhnam naw ami ngthu am jah mkhyah pe lü, khawvei jah yawkin khai aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, akdawa amimia phäh ngthu jah mkhya pe khai. Cunsepi khyanga Capa khawmdek khana a law be üng jumnak hmuh khai aw?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharise la Ngcawnklawka ani Ktaiyünak am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Acunüng, cingcai säikia ngaikyu lü, khyang he jah hmumsit khawiki he pharise hea veia hina msuimcäpnak a pyen, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/><char style="wj">“Khyang nghngih, Temple na, ktaiyü khaia citki xawi; mat cun Pharisea kya lü, mat cun ngcawnklawka kyaki. </char><verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pharise cun ngdüi lü, amät däng hinkba ktaiyüki;</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pharise cun ngdüi lü amät däng hinkba ktaiyüki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang üng ngdüiei ngha lü ktaiyüki tia ng’yuki. </char></note><char style="wj">‘Pamhnam aw, khyang kce hleihlakkie, am cingcäiki he la, hüipawmki hea kba am ka kya la, hina ngcawnklawka kba pi am ka kyaa phäha na khana jekyai veng. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/><char style="wj">“Mhmüp khyüh üng nghngih vei buh jeih lü, ka ktaiyü khawiki, ka tak avan xa üng mat ka pe khawiki,’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ngcawnklawk cun a thuknak üngka naw ngdüi lü, khana pi ä hang mdei ngawn lü, ‘Pamhnam aw, kei khyangka ni, na m'yeneia,’ ti lü, a mkyang kbeiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, Pharise am ni lü ngcawnklawk cun mhlätnak am ima cit beki. Amimät ak'hlünga ngai kyuki he cun hnem u lü, akhnema awmki he jah mhlünmtaia kya khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Hnasen he üng Josenak am a jah Kbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Khyang he naw Jesuha veia, ami ca he ami khana a kut a mtaih vaia jah lawpüi u se, axüisaw he naw hmu ü lü, ami jah na ksenak. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Cunsepi, Jesuh naw jah khüki naw, <char style="wj">“Anghmawca he ka veia law u se, ä jah mah u; Pamhnama khaw cun hina mäihea ham ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, upi, Pamhnama khaw hnasenca kba am dokhameiki cun, acuia am lut khai ni,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawimangpa mata Mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Acunüng, Judah hea ngvaipa mat naw Jesuh üng, “Saja kdaw aw, anglät xünnak ka yahnak thei vaia i ka pawh khai?” ti lü, a kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ivai akdaw, na na ti naki ni? Mhnam dänga thea u am daw. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ex 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deut 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ex 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deut 5:17</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Ex 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Deut 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:16">Ex 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Deut 5:20</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ex 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deut 5:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ngthupet he cun na jah ksingki, ‘Khyanga khyuca ä na katnak vai, khyang ä na hnim vai, ä na m'yuk vai, hleihlaknak am khyang ä na kpuk vai, na nu la na pa na jah mhlünmtai vai,’ tie cen,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Acunüng, acuna khyang naw, “Acun he cun ka nghmawca üng tün lü ka jah läk päng ni,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Jesuh naw ngja lü, <char style="wj">“Atuh mat na pawh vai ve ham ve, na tak avan jawi lü, m'yenkseki he üng jah yeta, acunüng khankhawa khawh na ta khai; acun käna law lü, na läk lawa,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Acuna khyang naw ngja lü, aktäa, bawimangkia kyase a mlung na leng lengki.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw a mlung naki ti hmu lü, <char style="wj">“Khawh da naki he, Pamhnama khaw ami luh vai aktäa khak ve, </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/><char style="wj">bawimangki Pamhnama khawa a lua kthaka ta, sanghnguksaü mpyüma nghnga k'uma a luh vai jäi bawk ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Acuna ngthu ngjaki he naw, “Acunüng, u küikyana kya thei khai aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga am a mkhüt, Mhnam naw mkhütki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Pita naw, “Tenga, keimi, kami imlo jah yawk hüt u lü, kami ning läk lawki,” ti se,<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki upi, Pamhnama khawa phäha, a ima pi kyase, a khyua pi kyase, a bena hea pi kyase, a nupaa pi kyase, a ca hea pi kyase jah yawkki cun, </char><verse eid="LUK 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>
    <char style="wj">atuha kcün üng akdäm bawk yah lü pha law khaia kcün üng pi anglät xünnak yah khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a Thihnak vaia Mawng a Pyen Akthumnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw xaleinghngih he akcea jah khü lü, <char style="wj">“Ngai u! Jerusalema mi cit khai, sahma hea yuk avan khyanga Capa üng kümkawi law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/><char style="wj">“Khyangmjükcea kut üng msuma kya khai, yaiha pawh khai he, ngkekhyakei sak khai he, ami mci am msawh khai he; </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/><char style="wj">kpai u lü hnim khai he; acunüng amhmüp thum üng thihnak üngka naw tho law be khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Acunüng, acuna ngthu axüisaw he naw asuilam am ksing u; acuna ngthu cun am ami ksing vaia mjiha kyase, Jesuh naw i pyenki tia pi am ksing u.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Amikmü, Kthäheiki a M’yai be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Acunüng, hinkba kyaki, Jerikho a pha law hlü üng, amik müki mat, lam peia kthähei lü ana ngawki. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Acun naw khyang he lam üng ami ceh ngja lü, “I ni” ti lü jah kthäh se,<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>amimi naw, Nazaret Jesuh a ceha mawng, ami mtheh.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Acunüng, amikmü naw ngpyang lü, “Davita Capa Jesuh aw! na m'yeneia,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Acunüng, maki he naw am a khihkheh vaia ami mtheh; cunsepi amikmü naw, “Davita Capa, na m'yeneia,” ti lü, ngpyang law ksehlenki.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ngdüi lü, a veia ami lawpüi vaia jah mtheh se a pei a pha law üng, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na hama i ka pawh vai na ngaiki?” </char>ti lü a kthäh. Acunüng amikmü naw,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Saja aw, hmuh thei vai ngaih veng,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hmua! na jumnak naw ning daw sak be ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Acunüng angxita, hmu law be thei lü, Pamhnam mküimto lü Jesuh läki; acunüng, khyang avan naw hmu u lü, Pamhnam mküimtoki he.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh la Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Jesuh Jerikhoa lut lü a ceh k'um üng, <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>khyang mat Zake ngming naki, ngcawnklawk ngvai awmki; aktäa bawimangki. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Acunüng, Jesuh hin khyang ia mäih ni ti, hmu hlü teki, khyang hea daa phäh la, amäta tawia phäha, am hmu thei lü awmki. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Acunüng, Jesuha lawnak vaia lam üng a na dawng lü, hmu khaia thingpama kaiki. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Jesuh naw, acun a pha law üng, han teng lü, a veia, <char style="wj">“Zake, angxita kyum law; tuhngawi na ima ka kai khaia kya ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Acunüng, Zake cun, angxita kyum law be lü, Jesuh jekyainak am a khinak. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Acun hmu u lü khyang van naw, “Khyangka veia kai khaia lut ve,” tia, ami mkatei.<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Acunüng, Zake naw ngdüi law lü Jesuh üng, “Ngaia, saja aw, ka khawhthem atiteh khuikha m'yenkseki he üng ka jah pe khai, khyanga ka iyaw amdanga ka lawhei üng, kphyüa pungkia ka thung be khai,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hin pi Abrahama capa kyase, tuhngawi küikyanak hina khuiim kyawng üng pha law ve. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mt 18:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa hin khyüki he jah sui lü, jah küikyan khaia lawki ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xüi Nguikcang am Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mt 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Acunüng, Jerusalem mlüh peia pha law u se, Pamhnama khaw ngdang law khaia ami ngaiha phäha khyang hea ksunga msuimcäpnak a pyen be tü cun, <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/><char style="wj">“Khyang kdaw mat, sangpuxanga kyanak ana va yah lü law be khaia athuknaka khawa citki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/><char style="wj">“Am a ceh hlan üng a m'ya he xa jah khü lü xüi nguikcang xa jah peki naw, Am ka pha law be ham üng hin am a na bilo u lü, a na pungsak ua,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, khaw khyang avang he naw, am ngja hlü u lü, ‘Hina jah uk vai am ngjahlü ve ung’ ti khaia, ngsä a hnua ami tüih. </char><verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, sangpuxang yah lü a law be üng, a m'ya he xüi tangka a jah pet cun, ami pung sak a ksingnak vaia a jah khü sak. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, akma säih naw law lü, ‘Saja aw, na xüi nguikcang xaa pungsak veng,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng ani naw, ‘m'ya kdaw aw, pawh thei veki; ajawca khana kcangnak vaia na awmkia kyase mlüh xaa bawia ning mcawn veng,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, anghngihnak pi law lü, ‘Saja aw, na xüi tangka mhmaa pungsak veng,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng ani naw, ‘Nang pi mlüh mhmaa bawia ning mcawn veng,’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akce be tü law lü, ‘Saja aw, na xüi tangka kpyawn am hlawp lü ka khäm, </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/><char style="wj">khyang kyunga na kyakia kyase ka ning kyüheiki; am na tak pi lo lü, am na saw pi na at khawikia kyase’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng ani naw, ‘M'ya kse, na pyena kba ka ning mkhyah pe khai. Khyang kyunga kya lü am ka tak pi lo lü am ka saw pi ka at khawiki ti na ksing üng, </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/><char style="wj">ise ka tangka, ngui taknak im üng pung khaia am na tak ni? Ka law be üng apung maha ka yah be vai sü,’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, a peia ngdüiki he üng, ‘A xüi tangka yut be u lü xüi tangka xa taki üng pe u,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/><char style="wj">Acunüng awmki he naw, ‘Saja aw, hin naw xüi tangka xa ta ye se’ ami ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Ka ning jah mthehki, taki he üng a taka khana mkhah si u lü am taki he cun ami takca küt pi jah yuh be vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, na hnengkie, ami sangpuxang vaia am na ngjahlüki he jah lawpüi u lü ka ma jah hnim law ua’ a ti,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Hlüngtainak am Jerusalema lutki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Acunüng, acunkba a pyen law päng üng, Jerusalem daa ami ma a na citki he. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Olip mcung ami ti, Betphake ja Bethanih mlüh pei a pha law üng, axüisaw he üngka nghngih jah tüi lü, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/><char style="wj">“Nani ma ngnam üng va cit ni lü nani va luh la, sanghngaksaü amceca, u naw am a ngcumnak ham, ngphung se nani hmu khai; sut ni lü kaih law ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ‘Ivai nani sutki ni?’ tia, ami ning jah kthäh üng, ‘Bawipa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa am acunüng Mahpa. </char></note><char style="wj">naw, hlüei ve’ nani ti vai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>A tüih xawi cit ni lü a jah mtheha kba ani va hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Sanghngaksaü, ani suh k’um üng kamahe naw hmu u lü, “sanghngaksaüca cen ivai nani sutki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>“Bawipa naw, hlüei ve” ani ti. <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Jesuha veia kaih law ni se sanghngaksaüa khana ami jih he jah phah u lü Jesuh ami ngawhsak. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>A cehnak lam üng ami suisak he ami jah phah.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Acunüng, Olip mcung üng ju kyumnak ami pha law üng, axüsawa khyang avan naw müncamkse he a jah bilawh ami jah hmuha phäha, jekyainak am angsanga Pamhnam mhlünmtai mküimto u lü, <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sal 118:26</ref></char></note> “Bawipa ngming üng lawkia sangpuxang hin Pamhnam naw dawnak pe seh! khankhawa dim’yenak ve lü, Mhnama veia hlüngtainak ve se” tia, Pamhnam mküimtoki he.<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Acunüng, khyanga ksunga Pharise avang he naw, “Saja aw, na xüisaw he am khihkheh khai hea jah mtheha,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, hin he ami ngdüm üng lunge ngpyang law khai he,”</char> ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Jerusalem a Kyahei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Acunüng, Jerusalem a pha law hlü üng Jerusalem hmu lü, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/><char style="wj">“Tuhngawi üng dim’yenaka phäh hlüki hin na ksinga ta daw khai sü! Cunsepi atuh am hmu thei veki,” </char>ti lü kyapki. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/><char style="wj">“Na ye he naw ning kcung u lü, ning kham u lü, ning küp u lü, ami ning kcungnaka kcün pha law khai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/><char style="wj">“Ning küikyan khaia Mhnama kcün am na ksingeia phäha na khyang he mah maha ning kpyeh u lü, lung matca hman pi na khana ä ngtaih khaia pawhnaka kcün pha law khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Temple üng Citki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mt 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Acunüng, Jesuh Temple k’uma va lutki naw, iyaw jah jawituki he jah ktäm lü, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Hesa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ka im ktaiyünaka ima kya khai tia ng’yuki, nangmi naw m'yukei hea ima pawh ve uki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lk 21:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw amhmüp tä se Temple k’uma jah mtheiki. Acunüng, ktaiyü ngvai he, thum ksing he la, ngnam üngka ngvai he naw ami mkhyüh vaia ami bü. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Cunsepi, khyang he naw a ngthu pyen naküt cun am ceh hlü taki hea kyase ikba ami pawh vai am ksing u.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuha ana taka Mawng Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mt 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Acunüng, khaw mhmüp mat cun Temple k'uma khyang he jah mthei lü thangkdaw a pyen k'um üng, ktaiyü ngvai he la thum ksing he cun axüngvai he am law u lü, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Jesuh üng, “Jah mtheha, ia ana am na pawh ni? U naw hina ana aning pet ni?” tia ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Kei pi mat ka ning jah kthäh khai na msang u; </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/><char style="wj">“Johan naw baptican a jah petnak thei hin Mhnam üngka aw? Khyang üngka aw?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Acunüng, amimät he ami mlung k’uma, “Mhnam üngka mi ti üng pi, ‘ivai Johan am nami kcangnak ni?’ ti hlü ve. <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>“Khyang üngka mi ti üng pi khyang avan naw Johan cun sahmaa ami ksinga kyase, lung am jah vawi hlü ve u,” tia ngai kyuki he. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Acunüng, msang u lü, “Hawia ka ni ti am ksing ve üng,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei pi ua ana am ka pawh ni ti am ning jah mtheh hlü veng,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Capyit Ngvawng Ngängki he am jah Msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mt 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Hesa 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, khyang he üng hina msuimcäpnak a jah mtheh, <char style="wj">“Khyang mat naw capyit ngvawng pyanki, k’äih khai he üng jah khah hüt lü athuknaka khawa di law khaia citki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, capyit kbih vai a kha law üng amäta hama capyit ktheih kbit khaia a m'ya mat ngvawng ngängki hea veia a jah tüih. Cunsepi avang he ngängki he naw acuna m’ya cun kpai u lü a jünga ami tüih be. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, a m'ya akce mat ami veia a tüih be kce, ngvawng ngängki he naw, kpai u lü, ngkekhyakei khaia pawhki he naw, a jünga ami tüih be. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, akce m'ya mat ami veia tüi be se acun pi aktäa ngkhe khaia kpai u lü kpunga ami tawn. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ngvawng mah naw, ‘Ikba ka pawh khai? Ka capa ka jawngnak bawi tüi süm vang, ani ta leisawng hman khai he ni,’ a ti. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, ngvawng ngängki he naw ami na hmuh la, ‘Hin hin khawh mkhawm khaia khyang ni, mi hnim vai, acunüng a khawh mi ka na khai,’ tia, ami ceng. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, capyit ngvawng üngka naw kpunga nawt u lü ami hnim. Acunüng capyit ngvawng mah naw ikba jah pawh law khai aw?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/><char style="wj">“Ngvawng mah law lü, ngvawng ngängki he jah hnim lü ngvawng pi khyang kce he üng jah pe khai,” </char>a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Acunüng, acun ami ngjak la, “Acukba ta am kya khai,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sal 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cunsepi, Jesuh naw jah teng lü, <char style="wj">“Hina ngthu ng’yuki hin i ni? </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">‘Sawngsaki he naw ami yawka lung cun, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">avana kthaka kyäp law säihki ni’ ti hin. </char><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Upi, acuna lunga khana kyaki cun yawp khai, Upi acuna lung naw a kyaksih cun mvuta mhmüi khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngcawn am Pet vai la Pet vai Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mt 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Acunüng, thum ksing he la ktaiyü ngvai he naw man u lü, ami kutnak vaia ami bü te, khyang he ami jah kyühei; msuimcäpnak a pyen cun, amimi jah mkat lü, a pyen ti ami ksinga phäha kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, ngthu a pyen law msawk man u lü, Romah Empero veia ami khyak vaia phäha, k’äih tele u lü mcih khai hea khyang kdawa kba awmkia khyang he ami jah tüih. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Amimi naw Jesuh üng, “Saja aw, cang yekia ngthu pyen lü na jah mtheiki, u am hngalang na lü akcanga Pamhnama lama ngthu na jah mthei khawiki ti kami ksingki; <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>“Romah bawi üng ngcawn kami ngcawn hin ngkawiki aw,” Am ngkawiki aw?” tia ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Cunsepi, Jesuh naw ami hleihlak jah ksing lü, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/><char style="wj">“Tangka mat na mhmuh law ua, ua müihmai la ua ngming ni a ng’yuk?”</char> a ti. Acunüng, amimi naw,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">“Romah Bawi” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acunüng Romah Bawia ka cun Romah Bawi üng pe u lü, Pamhnama ka cun Pamhnam üng pe ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Acunüng, khyang hea ma ngthu a pyen msawk, ami man vai i am hmu u; a jah msangnak cun aktäa kyüh u lü ä msimsawt u lü awmki he.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akthia Thawhnak bea Mawng Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mt 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Ngs 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, thawhnak be am ve, tikiea Saduke avang he, Jesuha veia law u lü, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Deut 25:5</ref></char></note> “Saja aw, Mosi naw a yuknak üng, khyang naw am ca lü a khyu a thih tak üng angsawn am a dütnak vaia, a bena naw a khäm be vai tia awmki. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>“Ajana ngbengna khyüh awmki he. Akcük säih khyu mahki am ca lü thiki. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>“Acunüng, anghnginak naw a khäm be, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Acunüng akthumnak naw a khäm be, acunkba bäa akhyühnak cäpa ami khäm be te am ca u lü avan naw ami thih tak. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>“Akdüta nghnumi pi thiki. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>“Ami van khyüh naw ami khyunak. Acunakyase, thawhnak bea mhmüp üng, ua khyua kya hlüki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Hina khawmdek khyang he ngkhyungla u lü awmki he; </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/><char style="wj">cunsepi, tuha thinak üngka naw tho be ngkawikia ngaikyuki he cun ä ngkhyungla be u lü, khyu ca vaia pi am ngpeei kyu be u lü; </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/><char style="wj">“Athiha pi am thi be thei ti u, khankhawngsä hea mäih law u lü, thihnak üngka naw ami thawh bea phäha Pamhnama ca hea kyaki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ex 3:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Mosi naw, akthi he tho be khai he ti lü saksiki. Cangcim üng kpyapa däinak pyen lü, ‘Pamhnam cun Abrahama Pamhnam, Isaka Pamhnam, Jakopa Pamhnam’ tia pyenki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam cun akthi hea Mhnama am kya, akxüng hea Mhnama kyaki. Ania phäha avan xüngki he ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Thum ksing avang naw msang u lü, “Saja aw, cang veki,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Acunkäna ipi am ami kthäh be theia phäha kyaki.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesijah a Kyanaka Mawng Ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mt 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ikba Mesijah cun Davita capa, ami ti thei ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><char style="wj">“Davit amät naw Mküinaka ng’äi üng pyen lü, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Bawipa naw ka Bawipa veia pyen lü: </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Ka kpat da ngawa, </char><verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Na ye he na khawkunga ka jah tak law vei däa, ka kpat da ngawa’ a ti. </char><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acukba Davit naw Mesijah üng, ‘Bawipa aw’ a ti üng ikba a mjükphyüia kya thei khai ni?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thum Ksingki he jah Cäieinak vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Acunüng, khyang he avana ngjaka, axüisaw hea veia, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/><char style="wj">“Thum ksing he jah cäiei na u; amimi cun suisak aksaü suisa u lü ngtaw hü vai jawngnaki he, jawihtuknaka leisawngnak am nghnukset kyu, Sinakoka ngawhnak kdaw ami yah vai la pawia akdaw säiha hmün ami yah vai ngjahlüki he, </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/><char style="wj">hmeinu hea khawhthem eiaw u lü, ami im jah yutei u lü, khyanga jah hmuha khawvei ktaiyüki he. Ami khamei vai akse säh ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Hmeinu mata Khawh pet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jesuh naw mang hü lü, bawimangki he naw, Temple khawh petnak üng ami khawh pe u se a jah hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Acunüng, m'yenksekia hmeinu mat pi, tangka ca nghngih pe law hnga se hmu lü, <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, hin hea kthaka pi, acuna m'yenkse hmeinu naw a pet däm bawk ve; </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/><char style="wj">“Hin he naw ami taka kpawih pe lawki he; cunsepi, hina hmeinu naw a xünnak vaia a tak naküt pe ve,” </char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Temple a Pyeh law vaia Mawng a Pyenak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mt 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mk 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he avang naw, Temple lunga kyäpa mawng, a dawa mawng la Pamhnam ami petmsawta mawng pyen u se, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hin atuh nami jah hmuh, hin üng lung matca pi am ve se, avan a kpyehnaka kcün pha law khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khuikhanak la Mkhuimkhanak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mt 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Amimi naw, “Saja aw, acun cun itia kya law khai? Acun a pha law hlü üng msingnak i ve law khai?” tia, ami kthäh.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä ami ning jah hleihlaknak vaia a na cäiei ua. Khyang khawjah naw, ‘Kei Khritaw ni,’ ‘Akcün pha law hlü ve,’ ti u lü, keia ngming pyen u lü, ngdang law khai he; acun he ä nami jah läk vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, ngtungahnak la nghnengnaka ngthu nami ngjak üng, ä nami kyüh vai. Acun he akcüka ve law khai he, cunsepi acuna phäha adütnak ng'et lawkia am kya pha naw. </char><verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pung la pung ngtu law khai he, khawe la khawe ngtu law khai he; </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/><char style="wj">“Mkhyü aknuia ngsün law khai, pung avana khawjaw law khai, mnehmnang da law khai, khankhawa am hmuh khawia msingnak he aktäkpaia ngdang law khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/><char style="wj">“Acun he avan am a pha law hlan üng, ka ngminga phäha, ning jah man u lü, ning jah mkhuimkha u lü, Sinakok la thawngima ning jah cehpüi khai he. Sangpuxang he la khawbawi hea veia ning jah cehpüi khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, acun cun thangkdaw nami pyenak vaia kcün kdawa kya khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Akcün am a pha law hlan üng ikba nami pyen be vaia ä cäi ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/><char style="wj">“Nami ye he naw, am ami ning jah nängnak vaia, khyaihnaka ngthu la ksingnak kei naw ka ning jah pe khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/><char style="wj">“Nami nu la nami pa he, nami hnunpüi he, nami püi he naw pi ning jah ceng u lü ning jah man law sak khai he; avang ning jah hnim khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/><char style="wj">“Keia ngminga phäha khyang avan naw ning jah hneng law khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, nami lusam matca pi am khyük khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/><char style="wj">“Nami khängceknak am nami ngküikyanei kyu khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema Pyeh law vaia Mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mt 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunüng, yekap he naw Jerusalem nglung law na u se nami hmuh üng, Jerusalem pyeh law hlüki ti nami ksing vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/><char style="wj">“Judah khawa awmki he mcung hea dawng u se; mlüh k’uma awmki he kpunga dawng u se; mlüh kpunga awmki he mlüh k’uma ä lut be u se. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Acuna mhmüp cun, cangcim üng ng’yuki akümnak vaia, Mkhuimkhanaka Mhmüpa kya khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mhmüp üng m'yaieiki he la naca kpawmeiki he ta ami jo se ve; hina mdeka khana khuikhanak cang pha law khai, hina khyang hea khana Mhnama mkhuimkhanak pha law khaia kyaki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/><char style="wj">“Avang he Mthikcim am jah hnim khai he, avang he pung kcea jah cehpüi u lü thawngim üng jah khyum khai he; khyangmjükce hea mhmüp am a küm hlana küt üng, Jerusalem cun khyangmjükce hea khaw keha ve khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyanga Capa lawnak be vaia Mawng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Hesa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hez 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Jol 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Malam 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nghngi, khya la aisi hea khana msingnak he ngdang law khai he; mliktui nghmüm law lü phu law se khawmdek khan avan üng khyang he kyükyawk u lü cäicah law khai he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/><char style="wj">“Khan ngsün law khaia kyase, khawmdek khana pha law khaia khuikhanak vai ngaihkyunak la kyühkyawk lawa phäha pi khyang he käikang law khai he.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Malam 1:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, khyanga Capa cun johit la hlüngtainak am khawngmei üng kyum law lü ngdang law khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/><char style="wj">“Acun hea tünei law üng, ngdüi u lü han teng u, nami hama küikyannak ng'et law ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fik Thing üng Ngtheingthangnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mt 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw ami veia msuimcäpnak pyen be lü, <char style="wj">“Fik thing la thing avan jah ngai u; </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/><char style="wj">“Hlip law se nami hmuh la khawkhye ng’et lawki ti nami ksingki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/><char style="wj">“Acukba bäa nangmi pi acun he awm law u se, nami jah hmu üng, Pamhnama khaw pha law hlüki ni ti ksing ua. </char><verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hina khyang he am thi pha u se, acun he avan pha law khai ti ksing u. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/><char style="wj">“Khankhaw la mce khyük ni se pi ka ngthu am khyük. </char><verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ngaiheinak vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acunakyase, a na cäiei u, am acunüng ta ei ngang, aw ngang u lü khawmdek khawhthema phäha nami mlunga bawngkha k'um üng, acuna mhmüp am nami sima pha law sawxat khai ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mhmüp cun ngvaia kba khawmdek avan üng awmkia khyang hea khana pha law khaia kyaki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, kya law khaia khuikhanak üngka naw phyawng u lü khyanga Capaa ma nami ngdüi hlawt khaia anglät se ktaiyü u lü a na k’äih ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunüng Jesuh cun amhmüp tä se Temple k'uma jah mthei lü amthan tä se Olip mcung ami tia ktaiyü khaia citki. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Angawi tä se a ngthu ngai khai hea khyang avan Temple üng citki he.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami Ceng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ex 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nghngen am bawi khaia buhpawhnaka pawi; lätnakpawi ami ti ng'et lawki.<verse eid="LUK 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Ktaiyü ngvai he la thum ksing he naw ami mkhyühnak vaia lam sui tekie khyang he jah kyüh u lü anghmüa hnim khai hea ami bü.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah naw Jesuh a Ceng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mt 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mk 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Acunüng, xaleinghngih üngka Judah Iskarot ami tia k'uma khawyam lut se, <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>ktaiyü ngvai he la Temple ngängki hea veia cit lü, Jesuh ikba man vai tia a jah va cengpüi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Amimi naw jekyai u lü ngui ami pet vaia ami mkhyäp. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Acunüng Judah Iskarot naw ngaisim lü khyang he am ami ve üng a jah mansak vaia lam suiki.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Lätnakpawi Buh ei khaia Ngcüngceiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mt 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Acunüng nghngen am bawikia buhpawh mhmüp, lätnakpawi vaia toca hnimnaka mhmüp pha law se, <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Jesuh naw, Pita la Johana veia, <char style="wj">Lätnakpawi buh mi einak vai va pawh ni,” </char>ti lü a jah tüih.<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Anini naw, <char style="wj">“Hawia pawh vai ni na ngjak hlü?”</char> ani ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Jesuh naw,<char style="wj">Mlüh the nani va luh üng, kpami k'am üng tui kawtki naw ning jah na khyum khai ni, a luhnaka ima nani läk vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/><char style="wj">“Imaha veia, ‘Saja naw, ka xüisaw he am lätnakpawi buh kami einak vaia khinim hawia ni? ti ve,’ nani ti vai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/><char style="wj">“Ani naw khin im angsawng kcang, ahmäi am kümki im khan ning jah mhmuh khai; acunüng va ngtüna ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>A jah mtheha kba cit ni lü ani va hmuh, acuia lätnakpawi buh ani va ngtünak.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawipa Müei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mt 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Acunüng Jesuh la a ngsä he eikbe üng atänga ei hmaihki he. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Am ka thih hlan üng hina lätnakpawi buh atänga ka ning jah eipüi vai ka ngja hlü leng lengki, </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, Pamhnama khawa hin akcanga am a kya hlana küt üng am ei hlü be ti veng,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Acunüng khawt lo lü Pamhnama veia jekyainak ngthu pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Hin hin lo u lü, ng’yet ua; </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/><char style="wj">ka ning jah mthehki, atuh üng tün lü Pamhnama khaw am a pha law cäpa capyitui am ka aw be ti khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Acunüng muk lo lü Pamhnama veia jekyainaka ngthu a pyen law päng üng, boki naw jah pe lü, <char style="wj">“Hin hin nami hama peta ka mtisa ni, nami na sümnak vaia pawh ua” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note>Müei a ei law päng üng, acunkba bäa khawt lo lü, <char style="wj">“Hina khawt hin ka thisen, nami hama ngsawikia Pamhnama ngthumkhän kthaia kyaki.</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hin hin nami hama peta ka mtisa ni tia Jesuha ngthu cun akyang kdik 19 la 20 avan üng avang naw am ami yuk si. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sal 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Acunakyasepi, na mansak khaia khyang cun hina eikbea khana kani awm hmaihki ni! </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/><char style="wj">Khyanga Capa hin Mhnama mkhyaha kba cit khai, cunsepi jah mansak khaia cengkia khyang ta a jo se ve,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Acunüng axüisaw he amimät, <char style="wj">“Acukba kya khai ta u ni?”</char> tia, ngthäh kyuki he.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kyäp säih vai Ngcuhki he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mt 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lk 9:46</ref></char>
    </note>Axüisaw he amimät, u ni akyäp säih tia ngcuh u se, <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mt 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mk 10:42-44</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Am jumeiki hea sangpuxang he cun khyang hea khana aktäa bawi khawiki he, khaw uki he naw ‘Khyang hea püi he’ tia ami jah khü jawngnaki he. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, nangmi ta acunkba ä awm u, nangmi üng kyäp säihki cen jaw säihkia kba, mkhawng säiki cen m'yaa kba ve se. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Jn 13:12-15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“U ni a kyäp säih? Ngaw lü buh eiki japaw a kyäp säih? Buh khünki aw a kyäp säih? Ngaw lü buh eikia am kya aih se? Cunsepi, kei ta nami veia ning jah khüihkia kba ka awmki. </char><verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khuikha lü ka awm üng nami na awmpüiki. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/><char style="wj">“Ka Pa naw uknak thei a na peta kba kei naw pi ka ning jah pe khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mt 19:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nangmi cun ka eikbe üng ngaw u lü ka khawa nami ei aw hnga khai. Bawingawhnak he üng ngaw u lü Isarel pakhui xaleinghngih he ngthu nami jah mkhyah khai. </char><verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita a Ngcimnak vai Jesuh naw a Pyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sihmon, Sihmon, Ngaia! lomah naw angsi kphya am a mkhyaha kba, khawyam naw a ning hlawhlepnak vaia akhawn yah päng ve, </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, na jumnak am a khyühnak vaia, ka ning ktaiyü peki ni; ka veia na nghlat law be üng, na bena he jah khängsak kaw pi,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, na veia ta thawngim la thihnak üng pi ka ceh vai ling veng,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pita aw, ka ning mthehki, tuhngawi ai am khawng pha se, ‘Ani am ksing nawng’ ti lü kthum vei na ngcim khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguiip, Ngja la Likcim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mt 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mk 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>
    </note> Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ajana, nguiip, ngja, khawdawk, am nami cehei khaia ka ning jah tüih üng, nami hlü ei i awmki aw?” </char>ti se amimi naw, “I am hlü naw,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Atuh ta aupi nguiip la ngja taki naw cehei se; kcim am taki naw a suisak jawi lü kheihei se. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Hesa 53:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mthehki, ‘Ani cun khyangka he mah maha ami täh si’ tia, ng’yuki ka khana kümkawi law khaia kyaki; keia mawngma ngthu he kümkawi law bäih ve u,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Amimi naw, <char style="wj">“Bawipa aw, tenga! kcim nghngih awmki,” ti u se, Jesuh naw, “Khäk ve” </char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khäk ve </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am acunüng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ahina phäha khäk ve. </char></note> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Olip Mcunga Ktaiyüki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Jesuh cun a thum khawia kba, Olip mcunga ktawih se, axüisaw he naw ami läk hnga. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ahmün a va pha üng, <char style="wj">“Hlawhlepnaknak üngka naw nami lätnak vaia, ktaiyü ua,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Lung vawi lü aphanak cäpa va cit lü; a mkhuk ngdäng lü, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Ka pa aw, na hlüei üng ta hina khuikhanak khawt ka vei üngka naw loin kawpi, cunsepi keia ngjak hlüa am kya lü, namäta ngjak hlüa kya se,” ti lü ktaiyüki. </char><verse eid="LUK 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Khankhaw üngka khankhawngsä mat Jesuh kthayüi pe khaia ngdang lawki. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Aktä leng lenga khuikha lü, kthana kcang lü, ktaiyü se a ngkhyantui thisena mäiha mdek üng ngsawi lawki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akyang kdik 43-44 avang üng am ami yuk si. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>A ktaiyü law päng üng tho law lü axüisaw hea veia cit teki ami mlunga nata phäha a na ip u se a jah hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ise nami ipki ni? Hlawhlepnak üngka naw nami lätnak vaia tho law u lü ktaiyü ua,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami Kpan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Acukba a na ngthuhei k’um üng, xaleinghngih he üngka Judah ami ti naw jah xüi lü, khyang he jah lawpüiki naw, Jesuh mhnam khai bü lü a pan law. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Judah aw khyanga Capa hin mhnam khaia bü lü na jah man sak khai aw?” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Acunüng axüisaw he a peia awmki he naw, ia akya law vai sim u lü, “Bawipa aw, kcim am kami jah pawh khai aw?” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Acunüng mat naw ktaiyü ngvai säiha m'yaa nghngakawi kpat lam a ksawm pat.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khäk ve,”</char> ti lü a nghngakawi hnet se daw beki.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Jesuh naw a veia lawki hea ktaiyü ngvai he, Temple üng ngvai he la, axüngvai he üng, <char style="wj">“Mthikcim la kpaihmäng jah kawtei u lü m'yukei man khai hea kba nami na lawsiki aw? </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Temple üng amhmüp tä nami veia ve ni se am nami na manki. Cunsepi atuh hin nami kcüna kya lü nghmüpa khyaihnaka kya ve,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita a Ngcimnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mt 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mk 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jn 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Jesuh kpang u lü cehpüiki he naw ktaiyü ngvaia ima ami luhpüi. Acunüng, Pita naw athuknak üngka naw a läk hnga. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Imngvawng mkawt nglung üng mei awm u lü ngaw u se Pita ami ksunga va ngaw hngaki. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Meikdäi peia ngaw se nglaca mat naw hmu lü a hmai üng teng kyetki naw, “Hina khyang pi Jesuh am awm khawiki xawi ni,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Pita naw, “Nghnumi aw, ani am ksing nawng,” ti lü, ngcimki. <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Acunkäna, khyang kce mat naw hmu lü, “Nang pi acun he üngka mat ni,” ti se, Pita naw, “Khyang aw, am kya nawng,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Acunüng naji mat ngsawk se khyang mat naw, “Hina khyang pi Jesuha hlawnga awm khawiki ni; Kalile khaw khyanga kya ye se,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Acunüng, Pita naw, “Khyang aw na pyen am ksing nawng,” a ti. A na ngcim k’um üng angxita ai khawng law ktäihki. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Jesuh naw nghlat lü Pita a teng. Pita naw Jesuha pyen, <char style="wj">“Tuhngawi, ai am khawng pha se kthum vei, ‘Am ksing nawng’ ti lü na ngcim khai,” </char>a ti cun süm law beki. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Acunüng, Pita kpunga cit lü aktäa kyapki.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Yaihei u lü ami Kbeih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mt 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Jesuh ngängki he naw yaiha pawh u lü ami kpaih. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>A mik bu u lü, “U naw ning kpaiki, pyena?” tia ami kthäh. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ngthu khawjah am kse na u lü ami jüih.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kawngci hea veia Jesuh ami Lawpüi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Khaw a thaih law la khyang ngvai he, ktaiyü ngvai he la, thum ksing he avang ngcun lawki he naw ami Kawngcia cehpüi u lü, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>“Mesijaha na kya kcang üng jah mtheh law,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ning jah mtheh ni se pi am nami na kcang na khai; </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/><char style="wj">ning jah kthäh ni se pi am nami na msang khai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/><char style="wj">Cunsepi, atuh üng tün lü khyanga Capa cun hlüngtai kyäpsawkia Pamhnama kpat da ngaw khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Acunüng ami van naw, “Nang hin Pamhnama Capa kya aih lü?” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä, nami pyena kba kya veng,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Amimi naw, “Ia saksi akce hlü be se ni? Amäta mka ye üng mi ngja ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Pilata veia ami Cehpüi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1">Mt 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Acunüng ngbumki he ami van tho law u lü Jesuh Pilata veia cehpüi u lü, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>“Hin naw, kami khyang he lam jah hma saki, kei Mesijah, sangpuxang ni ti lü Ketah sangpuxanga veia akhawn ä ngcawn vai ti se, kami ngjak,” tia ami mawm.<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilat naw, “Judah hea sangpuxanga na kyaki aw?” ti lü kthäh se, Jesuh naw,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">
    <char style="wj">“Ä, na pyena kba kya veng,” </char>ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Acunüng Pilat naw ktaiyü ngvai he la khyang hea veia, “Hina khyanga khana mkhuimkhanak vai ia mkatnak am hmu veng,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Cunsepi amimi naw “Kalile khaw üng tün lü, ahi düta Judah khaw avan üng jah mthei hü lü khyang avan jah kpyükpyeh hü bäihki,” tia, aksehlena ami pyen.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Heroda veia ami Cehpüi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilat naw ngja lü “Hina khyang hin Kalile khyang aw?” ti lü a jah kthäh. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Pilat naw Heroda uknaka khaw üngka ti a ksing üng Heroda veia a tüih be. Acunüng, Herod cun Jerusalema awmki. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herod naw Jesuh a hmu üng aktäa jekyaiki; isetiakyaküng a mawngma ngja lü ajandea a hmuh vai a ngaih, müncankse he a jah bilaw iyaw bawi ta a hmuh vai a büa phäha kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Ngthu khawjah a kthäh; cunsepi Jesuh naw i am pi am msang be. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Acunüng ktaiyü ngvai he la thum ksing he naw ngdüi u lü aktäa a mi mkatei. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herod la a yekap he naw Jesuh hmumsit u lü yaiha pawh u lü jinu akyäp cang suisaki he naw Pilata veia ami tüih be. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Acuna mhmüp üng Pilat la Herod ngpüi kyu naki xawi. Ajana ani püi ana hneng khawiki xawi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Thi khaia ami Mkhyäp</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mt 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilat naw ktaiyü ngvai he, angvai he la khyang he avan jah khü lü, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>“Khyang he lam jah hma saki ti u lü hin ka veia nami lawpüia kyaki; teng u, nami ma a katnak sui ni se nami mkata kba hina khana i a katnak am hmu veng; <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Herod naw pi a katnak cang am hmu naw, a veia ka tüih päng; teng u, thihnak sen vaia i am pawh ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>“Acunakyase, kpai lü khyah be vang,” a ti. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Buhpawh pawi üng khyang mat jah mhlät pet khawia thum awmki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Buhpawh pawi üng khyang mat jah mhlät pet khawia thum awmki tia akyang kdik 17 avang üng am ami yuk si. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ami van atänga ngpyang u lü, “Hin hin hnim lü, Barabah jah mhlät pea,” ami ti. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabah cun mlüh k’uma ksuksaknak pawh lü khyang a hnima phäha thawngima khyuma kyaki.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilat naw Jesuh a mhlät vai ngaih lü a jah kthäh be. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Cunsepi ngpyang u lü, “Kutlamktung üng taiha, Kutlamktung üng taiha,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilat naw akthumnaka, “Ise ni? Hin naw ia katnak ni a pawh ve? Thihnak sen vai a khana i am hmu veng; acunakyase kpai lü khyah be vang,” a ti. <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Cunsepi amimi naw angsang yea kutlamktung üng taih vaia amthuia mso u se, acunüng ami ngpyangnak am Pilat ami näng. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Acuna Pilat naw ami msoa kba Jesuh pawh vaia ngthu a jah pet. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Suksaknak pawh lü khyang a hnima phäha thawngim üng kyumki ami kthäh jah khyah pe lü; Jesuh cun ami ngaih ngaiha ami pawh vaia a jah pet.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Kutlamktung khana ami Taih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Jesuh ami cehpüi k'um üng, Karenih khaw üngka Sihmon naki ngnamca üngka naw lawki ami hmu üng, man u lü Jesuha hnua kutlamktung ami kawh sak.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>A hnua läki hea khyang khawjah üng Jesuh kyahki hea nghnumi avang awmki he. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Acun he Jesuh naw jah nghlat si lü, <char style="wj">“Jerusalema canu he aw, kei am na kyah u lü nami mäta phäh la nami ca hea phäha kyap ua. </char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, ‘cingkia nghnumi ta a jo sen ve, na am pawinakia pum la na naw am a awk khawia cih ta a jo sen ve’ ami tinaka mhmüp pha law khai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Malam 6:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng khawmcunga veia, ‘Jah sip lawa,’ khawngjung khawkawngea veia, ‘Jah mük lawa’ ti law khai he, </char> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/><char style="wj">“Thing xünga veia pi hinkba ami ti üng akhyawnga veia ta ikba kya khai aw?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Acunüng a veia khyangka nghngih ami jah hnim vaia ami jah cehpüi hnga. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Acunüng luyuh hmün ami tinak ami pha law üng acuia a kpat lama mat, a k'eng lama mat, khyangka xawi am kutlamktung üng ami taih. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, jah mhläta; i ami pawh am ksing hei ve u,”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34</char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Ka Pa aw, jah mhläta; i ami pawh am ksingei ve u” tia Jesuha pyen avang üng am ami yuk si. </char></note> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Acunüng, a suisak he cung kphawng u lü ami jah ngpaiei.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sal 22:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Khyang he naw ngdüi u lü ami tengei. Angvai he naw, “Khyang kce ta jah küikyan khawiki; Pamhnama a xü Mesijah kcang a ni üng amät pi ngküikyanei kyu se,” tia ami ksenak.<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sal 69:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yekap he naw pi yaiha ami pawh a veia capyit jukthui lawpüi u lü, peki he naw, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>“Judah hea sangpuxanga na kya kcang üng, namät la namät ngküikyanei kyua,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Acunüng a lu khana, “Hin hin, Judah hea sangpuxang ni,” tia ami taih.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Acunüng, khyangka mat, a peia ami taih naw pi, kse na lü, “Nang Mesijaha na kya üng, namät ngküikyanei kyu lü, keini pi jah küikyan lawa,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Cunsepi, akce mat naw a jüinak am msang lü, “Mhnam ye pi am na kyühki aw? Atänga mkhuimkhanak mi khamei hmaih ye se, <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>ningni cun ni khamei kung khaia ni kyaki; ni katnaka phu däng ni hlawheiki ni; hin naw ia katnak am pawh naw,” a ti. <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>“Jesuh aw, Sangpuxanga na law üng na sümeia,” a ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tuhngawi Paradaia ka hlawnga na ve khaia ning khyütam na veng,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Thiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ex 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun cun mhmüp naji xaleinghngiha kya lü, mülam naji kthum cäpa nghngi am vai lü avan üng khaw nghmüp lawki. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Acunüng Temple üng jihnu, anglung üng nghngiha tek lawki. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Sal 31:5</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Jesuh naw angsanga, <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, na kut üng ka ngmüimkhya ning pe veng,” </char>a ti. Acun ti lü thiki.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai naw acun a hmuh üng, “Hin hin akcanga khyang ngsungpyuna kya ve,” ti lü, Pamhnam mküimtoki.<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Khyang avan acun tengei khaia lawki he, acuna awm ihe ami jah hmu üng ami mkyang kbei u lü puksetnak am cit beki he. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Kalile khaw üngka naw läk lawkia nghnumi he la Jesuh ksingki he avan, acun teng u lü, athuknaka ngdüiki he.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami K'ut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Acunüng khyang mat Josep naki ngvainu, ngsungpyun lü dawki awmki. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Ani cun Kawngci member kya lü pi ami pawhmsah ami bilawh he am jah ngaisimkia kyaki. Judah khaw, Arimahte khyanga kya lü, Pamhnama khaw a na ngak’uhei khawiki, <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Pilata veia cit lü Jesuha yawk a kthäh. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Jesuha yawk khya lü jih am hlawpki naw, u pi am ami k'uhnak khawia, ng’uhnün üng a k'uh. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Acunüng, acuna mhmüp cun kyawngkai amhmanaka kya lü Sabbath mhmüp pha law hlüki.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Acunüng, Kalile khawa Jesuh läki nghnumi he cun Josep am atänga cit u lü, ng’uhnün la acunüng ikba Jesuha yawk ami tak cun tengki he. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Ex 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Deut 5:14</ref></char></note>Acunkäna nghlat be u lü, ng’uinghname la, situie jah pyang u lü thum naw a pyena kba Sabbath mhmüp üng xüieiki he.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh a Thawhnak Be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mt 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Ngpum mhmüp ngawiksik üng, ng'uingnam he jah ceh u lü, nghnumi he ng’uhnüna citki he. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Acunüng k'utnak üngka lungnu cun akcea ngtäng se hmu u lü, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>lutki he, acunüng Jesuha yawk cun am ami hmuh. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Acunüng, acuna phäha ami cäicah k'um üng, khyang nghngih akbawk suisa ni lü, ngdang lawki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Ami kyühnak am kawp u lü ami ve k'um üng anini naw, “Ivai akthia ksunga akxüng nami suiki ni? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6,7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mt 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> “Hia am ve ti naw, tho be päng ve; Kalilea a ve üng nami veia a ngthu pyen cen süm be ua, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘khyanga Capa, khyangka hea kut üng mansaka kya khai, kutlamktung üng taih khai he, amhmüp thum üng tho be khaia kyaki,’ a ti cen,” ani ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Acunüng a pyen süm law be u lü, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>ng’uhnün üngka naw cit beki he naw, xaleiat la akce hea veia acuna mawngma avan cun ami jah mtheh, <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Acuna nghnumi he cun, Marih Makdalin, Joanah la Jakuka nu Mariha kyaki he; ami veia nghnumi kce he naw pi acuna ngthu cun ngsä he üng ami jah mtheh hnga. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Cunsepi acuna ngthu cun ngthu sawxata kba, ia am msui u lü am ami kcangnak. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Pita tho law lü ng’uhnüna dawngki; acunüng kawp lü tengki naw, jih he däng ve se hmu lü aktäa cäi lü ima cit beki. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang üng akyang kdik 12 am ami yuk si.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emawk Cehnak lama Jesuh Ngdangki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Acuna mhmüp üng axüisaw xawi nghngih, Jerusalem üngka naw mäng khyüh thukia Emawk khawa ani ceh k'um üng, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Jerusalema iyawa awmih avan sumkyam ni lü citki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Acukba sumkyam ni lü ani ceh k'um üng, Jesuh naw jah pan law lü ani veia cit hngaki. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Jesuh cun ani hmuh te am ani ksing. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nani ceh maha i nani sumkyamki ni?” </char>ti lü jah kthäh se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">thuisei ni lü ngdüiki xawi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Acunüng, Kalawpah naki naw, “Jerusalem khawa tuhmüngawi iyawa awmih am na ksingkia khin hin nang däng aw?” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Ani naw, <char style="wj">“Ia ngkhaw ni?” </char>ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">anini naw, “Sahma Nazaret Jesuh, Pamhnam ja khyang avana hmuha a pyenksak la a bilawh üng a ngming ngthanga mawng, <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>ktaiyü ngvai he la mi ngvai he naw hnim vaia ami mso, kutlamktung khana ami taiha mawng cen, <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Isarel he jah küikyan khaia kami ngaih’uhei, acuna kyanak cun tuhngawi üng mhmüp thum law pängki. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>“Acuna thea pi kami vei üngka nghnumi he, khaw ngawilam ksika a ng'uhnak ng’uhnüna va cit u lü ami jah cäicatei law sak, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>a yawk am hmu u lü, ‘Pamhnama khankhawngsä he ami hmuha ngdang lawki he naw, Ani xüng ve tia pyen ve u,’ ami ti law. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>“Acunüng, kami veia ka avang ng’uhnüna cit u lü, nghnumi hea pyen lawa kba, ami va hmuh, cunsepi, amät cun am ami hmuh,” ani ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyang k'ang he aw, sahma hea pyen avan am kcang na thei khaia angki he aw! </char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/><char style="wj">Mesijah naw acun avan cun khamei lü a hlüngtainaka lut khaia am kya kungki aw?” </char>a ti. <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Acunüng, Mosi la sahma he avana yük üng tünei lü Pamhnama cangcim avan üng amäta mawngma ng’yuki avana suilam a jah mtheh.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Acunüng, ani cehnak vaia ngnam ani pha law hlü üng, Jesuh cun acuna khaw khye lü, athuknaka cit khaia kba ngtün se, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>anini naw, “Kani veia awmeia khaw mü lü khaw pi mthan law hlü ve,” ti ni se, acunüng ani hlawnga awm khaia lutki. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Acunüng Jesuh naw ani veia buh ei khaia, a ngawh üng, muk lo lü, josenak am kbeki naw, bo lü, a jah pet. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Acunüng, ani mik vai law se, Jesuh ni tia ani ksing law üng Jesuh cun khyükeiki. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Acunüng, axüisaw xawi naw, “Lama a jah ngthuheipüi üng, Pamhnama Cangcim he a jah mtheh k’um üng, ni mlung k'uma meidäikia mäih am kyakia kya kung aih se?” tia, animät ngthäh kyuki xawi.<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Acun la ngdüi law ni lü Jerusalema cit beki xawi naw, xaleiat he la ani püi he awm hmaihki he cun jah hmu ni se amimi naw, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>“Bawipa tho law be kcang ve, Sihmona veia pi ngdangki ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Acunüng, anini naw pi lam ani ceh k'um üng, akya lawa mawng, muk bo se, a müi ani ksing lawa mawng cun ani pyen hnga.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Axüisaw hea veia Jesuh Ngdangki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ngs 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Acuna ngthu ani pyen k'um üng, Jesuh ami ksunga ngdüi law lü, <char style="wj">“Nami khana dim’yenak ve se,”</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36</char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Nami khana dim’yenak ve se” tia Jesuha pyen avang üng am ami yuk si. </char></note> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Cunsepi, aktäa ngmüimkhya hmuki hea ngai u lü, ngpyangki he. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Cunsepi Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ise nami khuikhaki ni? Ise nami mlungmthin k'uma mlung hlawthlatnak awmki ni? </char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/><char style="wj">“Ka kut la ka khawpha he jah teng ua keiha ni ka kya ve, na hnet u lü na teng u; nami na hmuha kba ngmüimkhya naw mtisa la yuh am ta naw,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Acukba a pyen khap üng, a kut la a khawpha he a jah mhmuh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang üng akyang kdik 40 am ami yuk si. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Acunüng, ami jekyai law nganga phäha, am kcang na pha u lü, ami awm k'um üng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ei vai iyaw nami taki aw?”</char> ti lü, a jah kthäh. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Acunüng ami sawng päng nga amtawn ami pet. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Acunüng lo lü ami ma a ei.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Mosia thum, sahma hea cayuknak la mküinaka ng’äi üng, keia mawng ng’yuki avan kümkawi law khai tia, nami hlawnga ka awm üng ka ning jah mtheh khawi cun ahin he ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Acunüng, Pamhnama ngthu ami ksingnak vaia ami mlung a jah vaisak; <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>acunüng, ami veia, <char style="wj">“Mesijah naw khuikhanak khamei lü, amhmüp thum üng thihnak üngka naw tho be khai, </char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/><char style="wj">A ngming am, ngjutnaka ngthu la, katnak mhlätnaka ngthu, Jerusalem khaw üngka naw tün lü, khyang avana veia sang khai he, tia ng’yuki,’ </char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi cun ahin hea saksiha nami kyaki ni. </char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Ngs 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, ka pa naw a pyen nami khana ka tüi law khai; cunsepi, khana johit am nami yah hlana küt üng Jerusalema a na k’äih ua,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Khankhawa Kaiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ngs 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50,51</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ngs 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunüng Jesuh naw axüisaw he mlüh üngka naw Bethanih khawa jah cehpüiki naw a kut säng lü josenak am a jah kbe. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Acukba josenak a jah pet k’um üng axüisaw hea awmnak üngka naw khankhawa kai beki. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Axüisaw he cun sawhkhah u lü, jekyai leng leng u lü, Jerusalema nghlat beki he. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Acunüng, Pamhnam mküimto u lü, Temple üng awm nglätki he.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
